{"page": 97, "rows": [{"x": 60, "y": 41, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "不同於其他臺灣南島語，卡那卡那富語的sia-/se-/si-主要表達工具焦點，不"}, {"x": 47, "y": 53, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "表達受惠焦點，僅少部份疑問句或等同句可以表達「原因」，要呈現受惠語意或"}, {"x": 47, "y": 65, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "原因語意主要還是藉由vanai「原因」這個詞彙，如下面例句（6-11）~（6-12）"}, {"x": 47, "y": 76, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "所示。vanai不接任何時貌標記，如*ni-vanai, *te-vanai或*vanai=cu，但可以接"}, {"x": 47, "y": 88, "w": 111, "h": 7, "text": "祈使式主事焦點後綴-a，如（6-12c）。23"}, {"x": 44, "y": 107, "w": 59, "h": 6, "text": "（6-11）sia-表達原因"}, {"x": 69, "y": 119, "w": 61, "h": 6, "text": "a�neni sia-kuracʉPani�"}, {"x": 75, "y": 128, "w": 13, "h": 6, "text": "neni"}, {"x": 99, "y": 128, "w": 35, "h": 6, "text": "sia-kuracʉ"}, {"x": 152, "y": 128, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "Pani"}, {"x": 75, "y": 137, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "什麼"}, {"x": 93, "y": 137, "w": 51, "h": 6, "text": "原因焦點-生氣"}, {"x": 145, "y": 137, "w": 20, "h": 6, "text": "人名"}, {"x": 75, "y": 149, "w": 71, "h": 6, "text": "Pani為什麼原因生氣呢？"}, {"x": 69, "y": 164, "w": 86, "h": 7, "text": "b�putukikio sua sia-kuracʉPani�"}, {"x": 75, "y": 173, "w": 27, "h": 7, "text": "putukikio"}, {"x": 106, "y": 173, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "sua"}, {"x": 125, "y": 173, "w": 35, "h": 7, "text": "sia-kuracʉ"}, {"x": 178, "y": 173, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "Pani"}, {"x": 75, "y": 182, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "工作"}, {"x": 99, "y": 182, "w": 71, "h": 7, "text": "主格原因焦點-生氣"}, {"x": 171, "y": 182, "w": 20, "h": 7, "text": "人名"}, {"x": 75, "y": 195, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "Pani為了工作生氣。"}, {"x": 69, "y": 210, "w": 75, "h": 7, "text": "c�Mu’u sua sia-kuracʉPani�"}, {"x": 75, "y": 219, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "Mu’u"}, {"x": 99, "y": 219, "w": 11, "h": 7, "text": "sua"}, {"x": 119, "y": 219, "w": 34, "h": 7, "text": "sia-kuracʉ"}, {"x": 171, "y": 219, "w": 12, "h": 7, "text": "Pani"}, {"x": 75, "y": 228, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "人名"}, {"x": 93, "y": 228, "w": 71, "h": 7, "text": "主格原因焦點-生氣"}, {"x": 165, "y": 228, "w": 19, "h": 7, "text": "人名"}, {"x": 7