{"page": 126, "rows": [{"x": 60, "y": 41, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "ka’anʉ除了否定直述句外，也常常與表情態語意的詞彙如「確定」、「原"}, {"x": 47, "y": 52, "w": 199, "h": 7, "text": "本」、「真的」一起共用，表達「不一定」、「不應該」、「不可能」28等。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 71, "w": 159, "h": 7, "text": "（10-4）a�ka’anʉmunasʉ「不一定」（也表達「不確定」）"}, {"x": 73, "y": 80, "w": 132, "h": 7, "text": "tia kara cucuru pui’i sua Mu’u, ka’anʉpa munasʉ�"}, {"x": 73, "y": 89, "w": 25, "h": 7, "text": "tia=kara"}, {"x": 139, "y": 89, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "cu-curu"}, {"x": 178, "y": 89, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "pui’i"}, {"x": 197, "y": 89, "w": 12, "h": 7, "text": "sua"}, {"x": 210, "y": 89, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "Mu’u"}, {"x": 73, "y": 98, "w": 97, "h": 7, "text": "非實現=是非疑問詞重疊-真的"}, {"x": 171, "y": 98, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "回"}, {"x": 191, "y": 98, "w": 39, "h": 7, "text": "主格人名"}, {"x": 73, "y": 110, "w": 31, "h": 7, "text": "ka’anʉ=pa"}, {"x": 112, "y": 110, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "munasʉ"}, {"x": 73, "y": 119, "w": 59, "h": 7, "text": "否定詞=還直行的"}, {"x": 73, "y": 131, "w": 94, "h": 7, "text": "Mu’u真的會回來嗎？還不確定。"}, {"x": 67, "y": 147, "w": 135, "h": 7, "text": "b�natia ka’anʉ「不應該」（也表達「原本不該」）"}, {"x": 73, "y": 156, "w": 167, "h": 7, "text": "cucuruin kasu marʉ’ʉ’ikua ia, natia ka’anʉmakasia pokarikari�"}, {"x": 73, "y": 165, "w": 48, "h": 6, "text": "cu-curu=in=kasu"}, {"x": 158, "y": 165, "w": 22, "h": 7, "text": "marʉ’ʉ"}, {"x": 184, "y": 165, "w": 17, "h": 7, "text": "’ikua"}, {"x": 217, "y": 165, "w": 6, "h": 6, "text": "ia"}, {"x": 73, "y": 174, "w": 93, "h": 6, "text": "重疊-真的=如果=你�主格愛"}, {"x": 178, "y": 174, "w": 31, "h": 6, "text": "我�斜格"}, {"x": 210, "y": 174, "w": 20, "h": 6, "text": "主題"}, {"x": 73, "y": 186, "w": 18, "h": 7, "text": "na-tia"}, {"x": 119, "y": 186, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "ka’anʉ"}, {"x": 152, "y": 186, "w": 24, "h": 7, "text": "makásua"}, {"x": 184, "y": 186, "w": 31, "h": 7, "text": "po-kari-kari"}, {"x": 73, "y": 195, "w": 38, "h": 6, "text": "原本-非實現"}, {"x": 112, "y": 195, "w": 28, "h": 6, "text": "否定詞"}, {