{"page": 142, "rows": [{"x": 70, "y": 41, "w": 139, "h": 6, "text": "b�makananu sikamasinang nipatikurua Paicʉmiʉra?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 50, "w": 32, "h": 6, "text": "makananu"}, {"x": 112, "y": 50, "w": 41, "h": 6, "text": "sika-masinang"}, {"x": 158, "y": 50, "w": 38, "h": 6, "text": "ni-pa-tikuru-a"}, {"x": 76, "y": 59, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "如何"}, {"x": 112, "y": 59, "w": 28, "h": 6, "text": "SIKA-紅"}, {"x": 152, "y": 59, "w": 83, "h": 6, "text": "完成貌-使動-衣服-關係詞"}, {"x": 76, "y": 71, "w": 18, "h": 6, "text": "Paicʉ"}, {"x": 99, "y": 71, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "miʉra"}, {"x": 76, "y": 80, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "人名"}, {"x": 93, "y": 80, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "昨天"}, {"x": 76, "y": 92, "w": 73, "h": 7, "text": "Paicʉ昨天穿的衣服多紅?"}, {"x": 60, "y": 111, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "makananu可以簡化為mananu的形式，與前綴kin(a)-「（與某人成為）某種"}, {"x": 47, "y": 123, "w": 157, "h": 6, "text": "關係」共用，形成kinamananu，詢問怎樣的關係身分："}, {"x": 44, "y": 141, "w": 136, "h": 7, "text": "（11-16）a�Q: kinamananu sua’angai mataa’uva?"}, {"x": 85, "y": 150, "w": 36, "h": 7, "text": "kina-mananu"}, {"x": 126, "y": 150, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "sua"}, {"x": 145, "y": 150, "w": 18, "h": 7, "text": "’angai"}, {"x": 171, "y": 150, "w": 18, "h": 7, "text": "mataa"}, {"x": 197, "y": 150, "w": 12, "h": 7, "text": "’uva"}, {"x": 85, "y": 159, "w": 32, "h": 6, "text": "關係-如何"}, {"x": 119, "y": 159, "w": 43, "h": 6, "text": "主格人名"}, {"x": 165, "y": 159, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "和"}, {"x": 191, "y": 159, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "人名"}, {"x": 85, "y": 171, "w": 97, "h": 7, "text": "’angai和’uva之間的關係是什麼？"}, {"x": 77, "y": 187, "w": 94, "h": 7, "text": "A: kinvavara sua’angai mataa’uva�"}, {"x": 85, "y": 196, "w": 32, "h": 6, "text": "kin-va-vara"}, {"x": 139, "y": 196, "w": 10, "h": 6, "text": "sua"}, {"x": 158, "y": 196, "w": 18, "h": 6, "text": "’angai"}, {"x": 184, "y": 196, "w": 17, "h": 6, "text": "mataa"}, {"x": 210, "y": 196, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "’uva"}, {"x": 85, "y": 205, "w": 88, "h": 6, "text": "關係-重疊-手足主格人名"}, {"x": 178, "y": 205, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "和"}, {"x": 204, "y": 205, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "人名"}, {"x": 85, "y": 217, "w": 64, "h": 7, "text": "’angai和’uva是手足。"}, {"x": 60, "y": 233, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "makananu雖是動詞性疑問詞，有時視上下文的語氣，說話者不在詢問資"}, {"x": 47, "y": 244, "w": 185, "h": 7, "text": "訊，而是在表達當下主觀情緒的驚嘆或訝異，如（11-17）所示。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 263, "w": 69, "h": 7, "text": "（11-17）te cu makananu!"}, {"x": 70, "y": 272, "w": 18, "h": 6, "text": "te=cu"}, {"x": 132, "y": 272, "w": 29, "h": 6, "text": "makananu!"}, {"x": 70, "y": 281, "w": 54, "h": 6, "text": "非實現=狀態改變"}, {"x": 125, "y": 281, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "如何"}, {"x": 70, "y": 293, "w": 39, "h": 7, "text": "要怎麼辦啊！"}, {"x": 47, "y": 309, "w": 85, "h": 7, "text": "11�3�2�1�2「何時；什麼時候」"}, {"x": 60, "y": 321, "w": 213, "h": 7, "text": "卡那卡那富語疑問詞nukanmana/nukunmana31或minmana表達「何時；什麼"}, {"x": 47, "y": 333, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "時候」，nukanmana/nukunmana通常表示說話者知道詢問之事未發生，minmana"}, {"x": 47, "y": 345, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "則是知道詢問之事已發生。這兩個疑問動詞可以出現在句首當謂語，可與時貌"}, {"x": 47, "y": 357, "w": 172, "h": 6, "text": "標記共用，附著式代名詞也可附著其上，如（11-18）所示。"}, {"x": 47, "y": 389, "w": 63, "h": 5, "text": "31　nukanmana比較常見。"}, {"x": 22, "y": 31, "w": 6, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 19, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 57, "text": "第十一章　疑問句結構"}, {"x": 20, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "118"}]}
{"page": 143, "rows": [{"x": 44, "y": 41, "w": 125, "h": 6, "text": "（11-18）a�nukunmana kita múkusa na Taipe?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 50, "w": 47, "h": 6, "text": "nukunmana=kita"}, {"x": 152, "y": 50, "w": 27, "h": 6, "text": "m-ukusa"}, {"x": 197, "y": 50, "w": 10, "h": 6, "text": "na"}, {"x": 223, "y": 50, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "Taipe"}, {"x": 76, "y": 59, "w": 65, "h": 6, "text": "何時=我們�包含�主格"}, {"x": 145, "y": 59, "w": 44, "h": 6, "text": "主事焦點�去"}, {"x": 191, "y": 59, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "處格"}, {"x": 217, "y": 59, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "台北"}, {"x": 76, "y": 71, "w": 65, "h": 6, "text": "我們什麼時候去台北？"}, {"x": 70, "y": 86, "w": 81, "h": 7, "text": "b�tia nukanmana nguain pui’i?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 95, "w": 8, "h": 7, "text": "tia"}, {"x": 106, "y": 95, "w": 34, "h": 7, "text": "nukanmana"}, {"x": 145, "y": 95, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "nguain"}, {"x": 178, "y": 95, "w": 12, "h": 7, "text": "pui’i"}, {"x": 76, "y": 104, "w": 22, "h": 7, "text": "非實現"}, {"x": 99, "y": 104, "w": 22, "h": 7, "text": "何時"}, {"x": 139, "y": 104, "w": 31, "h": 7, "text": "他�主格"}, {"x": 171, "y": 104, "w": 44, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點�回"}, {"x": 76, "y": 117, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "他什麼時候要回來？"}, {"x": 70, "y": 132, "w": 91, "h": 7, "text": "c�minmana kasu cinimʉ’ʉra’inia?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 141, "w": 41, "h": 7, "text": "minmana=kasu"}, {"x": 125, "y": 141, "w": 49, "h": 7, "text": "c<in><Vm>ʉ’ʉra"}, {"x": 204, "y": 141, "w": 12, "h": 7, "text": "’inia"}, {"x": 76, "y": 150, "w": 45, "h": 7, "text": "何時=你�主格"}, {"x": 125, "y": 150, "w": 102, "h": 7, "text": "<完成貌><主事焦點>看他�斜格"}, {"x": 76, "y": 162, "w": 65, "h": 7, "text": "你什麼時候看到他的？"}, {"x": 47, "y": 178, "w": 188, "h": 7, "text": "11�3�2�1�3　amiseni「怎麼說；如何說」；miseni「為什麼；怎麼」"}, {"x": 60, "y": 190, "w": 213, "h": 7, "text": "如同makananu一樣，疑問詞amiseni「怎麼說；如何說」及miseni「為什"}, {"x": 47, "y": 202, "w": 182, "h": 7, "text": "麼；怎麼」皆不帶焦點變化，出現在句首當謂語，如（11-19）："}, {"x": 44, "y": 221, "w": 91, "h": 6, "text": "（11-19）a�amiseni tamu sarunai?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 230, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "amiseni"}, {"x": 106, "y": 230, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "tamu"}, {"x": 132, "y": 230, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "sarunai"}, {"x": 76, "y": 239, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "怎麼說"}, {"x": 99, "y": 239, "w": 48, "h": 6, "text": "祖父母男性"}, {"x": 76, "y": 251, "w": 39, "h": 6, "text": "祖父怎麼說？"}, {"x": 70, "y": 266, "w": 58, "h": 7, "text": "b�amiseni kasua cina?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 275, "w": 25, "h": 7, "text": "amiseni"}, {"x": 106, "y": 275, "w": 18, "h": 7, "text": "kasua"}, {"x": 139, "y": 275, "w": 14, "h": 7, "text": "cina"}, {"x": 76, "y": 284, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "怎麼說"}, {"x": 99, "y": 284, "w": 31, "h": 7, "text": "你�斜格"}, {"x": 132, "y": 284, "w": 20, "h": 7, "text": "媽媽"}, {"x": 76, "y": 297, "w": 52, "h": 6, "text": "媽媽對你怎麼說？"}, {"x": 70, "y": 312, "w": 87, "h": 7, "text": "c�miseni muruvakʉkʉkʉmusu?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 321, "w": 20, "h": 7, "text": "miseni"}, {"x": 106, "y": 321, "w": 30, "h": 7, "text": "muruvakʉ"}, {"x": 145, "y": 321, "w": 33, "h": 7, "text": "kʉkʉ=musu"}, {"x": 76, "y": 330, "w": 22, "h": 7, "text": "為什麼"}, {"x": 99, "y": 330, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "腫脹"}, {"x": 139, "y": 330, "w": 51, "h": 7, "text": "小腿=你�屬格"}, {"x": 76, "y": 342, "w": 60, "h": 7, "text": "你的腿為什麼腫了？"}, {"x": 70, "y": 358, "w": 62, "h": 7, "text": "d�miseni múkusa’inia?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 367, "w": 20, "h": 6, "text": "miseni"}, {"x": 106, "y": 367, "w": 28, "h": 6, "text": "m-ukusa"}, {"x": 152, "y": 367, "w": 12, "h": 7, "text": "’inia"}, {"x": 76, "y": 376, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "為什麼"}, {"x": 99, "y": 376, "w": 66, "h": 6, "text": "主事焦點-去那裡"}, {"x": 76, "y": 388, "w": 52, "h": 7, "text": "為什麼要去那邊？"}, {"x": 293, "y": 31, "w": 5, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 290, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 57, "text": "第十一章　疑問句結構"}, {"x": 290, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "119"}]}
{"page": 144, "rows": [{"x": 60, "y": 41, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "miseni跟makananu一樣，有時視上下文的語氣，可以表達說話者當下主觀"}, {"x": 47, "y": 53, "w": 133, "h": 6, "text": "情緒的驚嘆、訝異或不滿，如（11-20）所示。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 71, "w": 148, "h": 7, "text": "（11-20）miseni kasu makásua! cucuruana kasu natutu!"}, {"x": 70, "y": 80, "w": 38, "h": 7, "text": "miseni=kasu"}, {"x": 119, "y": 80, "w": 28, "h": 7, "text": "makásua!"}, {"x": 152, "y": 80, "w": 50, "h": 7, "text": "cu-curu-ana=kasu"}, {"x": 70, "y": 89, "w": 64, "h": 7, "text": "怎麼=你�主格那樣"}, {"x": 145, "y": 89, "w": 103, "h": 7, "text": "重疊-真的-感嘆語氣詞=你�主格"}, {"x": 70, "y": 101, "w": 18, "h": 7, "text": "natutu!"}, {"x": 70, "y": 110, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "頑皮"}, {"x": 70, "y": 123, "w": 85, "h": 6, "text": "你怎麼那樣！你真是頑皮啊！"}, {"x": 47, "y": 139, "w": 106, "h": 6, "text": "11�3�2�2　構詞式複合型動詞性疑問詞"}, {"x": 60, "y": 151, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "在卡那卡那富語裡，除了詞彙型疑問動詞之外，尚有構詞式複合型動詞性"}, {"x": 47, "y": 162, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "疑問詞，其形式為動詞前綴加上疑問詞，形成構詞式複合型動詞性疑問詞，"}, {"x": 47, "y": 174, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "如kara-nómani「喝什麼」、mo-peen「去幾次」等，能產性極高。如一般的疑問"}, {"x": 47, "y": 186, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "動詞一樣，構詞式複合型動詞性疑問詞可以出現在句首當謂語，可以帶時貌詞"}, {"x": 47, "y": 198, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "綴，附著式代名詞也可以附著其上。除此之外，也可以出現在連動結構裡，顯"}, {"x": 47, "y": 210, "w": 144, "h": 6, "text": "示他們是動詞，而非名詞或副詞。以下一一介紹。"}, {"x": 47, "y": 228, "w": 78, "h": 7, "text": "11�3�2�2�1　-nómani32疑問詞"}, {"x": 60, "y": 241, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "這一類疑問詞由疑問詞根-nómani「什麼」與各式動詞前綴所組成的構詞式"}, {"x": 47, "y": 253, "w": 180, "h": 6, "text": "複合型疑問動詞，表達「（做了）什麼」的語意，如下面例句："}, {"x": 44, "y": 271, "w": 163, "h": 7, "text": "（11-21）a�nikaranómani kasu? miseni mavucʉrʉkʉcu kasu?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 280, "w": 55, "h": 7, "text": "ni-kara-nómani=kasu"}, {"x": 76, "y": 289, "w": 75, "h": 7, "text": "完成貌-喝-什麼=你�主格"}, {"x": 76, "y": 301, "w": 20, "h": 7, "text": "miseni"}, {"x": 106, "y": 301, "w": 60, "h": 7, "text": "ma-vucʉrʉkʉ=cu=kasu"}, {"x": 76, "y": 310, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "為什麼"}, {"x": 99, "y": 310, "w": 105, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點-飽=狀態改變=你�主格"}, {"x": 76, "y": 323, "w": 84, "h": 6, "text": "你喝了什麼？為什麼你飽了？"}, {"x": 70, "y": 338, "w": 70, "h": 7, "text": "b�konómani kamu tammi?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 347, "w": 51, "h": 7, "text": "ko-nómani=kamu"}, {"x": 145, "y": 347, "w": 17, "h": 7, "text": "tammi"}, {"x": 76, "y": 356, "w": 61, "h": 7, "text": "吃-什麼=你們�主格"}, {"x": 139, "y": 356, "w": 19, "h": 7, "text": "地瓜"}, {"x": 76, "y": 368, "w": 160, "h": 7, "text": "你們吃怎樣的地瓜？（詢問哪一種類的，水煮的或烤的）"}, {"x": 47, "y": 390, "w": 73, "h": 5, "text": "32　年長的族人會唸naumani。"}, {"x": 22, "y": 31, "w": 6, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 19, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 57, "text": "第十一章　疑問句結構"}, {"x": 20, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "120"}]}
{"page": 145, "rows": [{"x": 47, "y": 41, "w": 82, "h": 7, "text": "11�3�2�2�2　-peni/-peen疑問詞"}, {"x": 60, "y": 53, "w": 213, "h": 7, "text": "這一類疑問詞是由疑問詞根-peni/-peen「幾次」與各式動詞前綴所組成的構"}, {"x": 47, "y": 65, "w": 193, "h": 7, "text": "詞式複合型疑問動詞，表達「（做了）幾回」的語意，如下面例句："}, {"x": 44, "y": 84, "w": 103, "h": 6, "text": "（11-22）a�te kasu makapeni pupui’i?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 93, "w": 25, "h": 6, "text": "te=kasu"}, {"x": 132, "y": 93, "w": 34, "h": 6, "text": "ma-ka-peni"}, {"x": 197, "y": 93, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "pu-pui’i"}, {"x": 76, "y": 101, "w": 111, "h": 7, "text": "非實現=你�主格主事焦點-做-幾次"}, {"x": 191, "y": 101, "w": 30, "h": 7, "text": "重疊-回"}, {"x": 76, "y": 114, "w": 45, "h": 6, "text": "你要來回幾趟？"}, {"x": 70, "y": 129, "w": 66, "h": 7, "text": "b�’urupeni cu kasu tuku?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 138, "w": 51, "h": 7, "text": "’uru-peni=cu=kasu"}, {"x": 171, "y": 138, "w": 12, "h": 7, "text": "tuku"}, {"x": 76, "y": 147, "w": 108, "h": 7, "text": "使用-幾次=狀態改變=你�主格鋤頭"}, {"x": 76, "y": 159, "w": 58, "h": 7, "text": "你使用了幾次鋤頭？"}, {"x": 70, "y": 175, "w": 67, "h": 7, "text": "c�te kamu kopeni tammi?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 184, "w": 26, "h": 7, "text": "te=kamu"}, {"x": 139, "y": 184, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "ko-peni"}, {"x": 171, "y": 184, "w": 17, "h": 7, "text": "tammi"}, {"x": 76, "y": 193, "w": 108, "h": 6, "text": "非實現=你們�主格吃-幾次地瓜"}, {"x": 76, "y": 205, "w": 58, "h": 7, "text": "你們要吃幾次地瓜？"}, {"x": 70, "y": 221, "w": 95, "h": 6, "text": "d�pirapeni nguain angírisi na Paicʉ?"}, {"x": 76, "y": 230, "w": 26, "h": 6, "text": "pira-peni"}, {"x": 112, "y": 230, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "nguain"}, {"x": 145, "y": 230, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "angírisi"}, {"x": 171, "y": 230, "w": 10, "h": 6, "text": "na"}, {"x": 191, "y": 230, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "Paicʉ"}, {"x": 76, "y": 239, "w": 28, "h": 6, "text": "分-幾次"}, {"x": 106, "y": 239, "w": 57, "h": 6, "text": "他�主格豬肉"}, {"x": 165, "y": 239, "w": 39, "h": 6, "text": "處格人名"}, {"x": 76, "y": 251, "w": 67, "h": 6, "text": "他分幾次豬肉給Paicʉ？"}, {"x": 293, "y": 31, "w": 5, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 290, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 57, "text": "第十一章　疑問句結構"}, {"x": 290, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "121"}]}
{"page": 146, "rows": [{"x": 22, "y": 31, "w": 6, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 19, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 57, "text": "第十一章　疑問句結構"}, {"x": 20, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "122"}]}
{"page": 147, "rows": [{"x": 47, "y": 40, "w": 128, "h": 14, "text": "第十二章　連動結構"}, {"x": 60, "y": 72, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "本章要探討的是卡那卡那富語的連動結構。連動結構是指兩個或兩個以上"}, {"x": 47, "y": 84, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "的動詞串連，共同組成的單一謂語。一般而言，連動結構中的所有動詞會有一"}, {"x": 47, "y": 96, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "個共同的事件參與者，這共同的事件參與者在這些動詞中，有時扮演相同的語"}, {"x": 47, "y": 107, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "意角色，即動詞的主事者；有時扮演不同的語意角色，通常是第一個動詞的受"}, {"x": 47, "y": 119, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "事者，同時也是其後動詞的主事者，這種結構有些學者稱之為「樞紐結構」。以"}, {"x": 47, "y": 131, "w": 183, "h": 7, "text": "下針對卡那卡那富語連動結構的語法特徵及類型，分節說明之。"}, {"x": 47, "y": 150, "w": 102, "h": 9, "text": "12�1　連動結構語法特徵"}, {"x": 60, "y": 165, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "如上述，連動結構是指兩個或兩個以上的動詞串連，共同組成的單一謂"}, {"x": 47, "y": 176, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "語。一般而言，連動結構中的兩個動詞會有一個共有的事件參與者，此共有的"}, {"x": 47, "y": 188, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "事件參與者在兩個動詞中，有時語意角色相同，有時會扮演不同的語意角色；"}, {"x": 47, "y": 200, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "如果是扮演不同的語意角色時，通常是第一個動詞的受事者，也同時是第二個"}, {"x": 47, "y": 212, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "動詞的主事者。某些語言的連動結構，其動詞串彼此之間不允許任何補語標"}, {"x": 47, "y": 224, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "記、連接詞或是連繫詞的出現，然而某些語言的連動結構，其動詞串彼此之間"}, {"x": 47, "y": 236, "w": 78, "h": 6, "text": "卻一定要有連繫詞的出現。"}, {"x": 60, "y": 254, "w": 213, "h": 7, "text": "連動結構有許多種類，功能上也有多種。不過其共同點是，連動結構中的"}, {"x": 47, "y": 266, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "所有動詞（V1、V2、V3）共同指涉概念上的單一事件，有以下四個基本的構"}, {"x": 47, "y": 278, "w": 39, "h": 7, "text": "詞語法特徵："}, {"x": 44, "y": 297, "w": 229, "h": 6, "text": "（A）連動結構中的所有動詞（V1、V2、V3等），在非連動結構時，均可單獨成"}, {"x": 62, "y": 309, "w": 45, "h": 6, "text": "為獨立的謂語。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 321, "w": 197, "h": 6, "text": "（B）連動結構中的V2以及其後的動詞，不能單獨接代名詞依附詞。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 332, "w": 161, "h": 7, "text": "（C）連動結構中的所有動詞共享一個時制與動貌標記。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 344, "w": 229, "h": 7, "text": "（D）連動結構中的所有動詞共享一個否定標記，不同於兩個句子中的動詞各自"}, {"x": 62, "y": 356, "w": 39, "h": 7, "text": "單獨被否定。"}, {"x": 293, "y": 31, "w": 5, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 290, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 51, "text": "第十二章　連動結構"}, {"x": 290, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "123"}]}
{"page": 148, "rows": [{"x": 60, "y": 41, "w": 98, "h": 6, "text": "試比較以下卡那卡那富語的例句："}, {"x": 44, "y": 59, "w": 146, "h": 7, "text": "（12-1）a�te ku múkusa tamia’aa camai pu’a vutúkuru�"}, {"x": 73, "y": 68, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "te=ku"}, {"x": 132, "y": 68, "w": 24, "h": 7, "text": "m-ukusa"}, {"x": 178, "y": 68, "w": 27, "h": 7, "text": "tamia’a-a"}, {"x": 223, "y": 68, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "camai"}, {"x": 73, "y": 77, "w": 49, "h": 7, "text": "非實現=我�主格"}, {"x": 125, "y": 77, "w": 45, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點-去"}, {"x": 171, "y": 77, "w": 45, "h": 7, "text": "販賣-關係詞"}, {"x": 217, "y": 77, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "菜"}, {"x": 73, "y": 89, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "pu’a"}, {"x": 119, "y": 89, "w": 24, "h": 7, "text": "vutúkuru"}, {"x": 73, "y": 98, "w": 37, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點�買"}, {"x": 112, "y": 98, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "魚"}, {"x": 73, "y": 111, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "我要去菜市場買魚。"}, {"x": 67, "y": 126, "w": 139, "h": 7, "text": "b�te ku múkusa tamia’aa camai; te ku pu’a vutúkuru�"}, {"x": 73, "y": 135, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "te=ku"}, {"x": 132, "y": 135, "w": 31, "h": 7, "text": "m-ukusa"}, {"x": 178, "y": 135, "w": 27, "h": 7, "text": "tamia’a-a"}, {"x": 223, "y": 135, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "camai"}, {"x": 73, "y": 144, "w": 49, "h": 7, "text": "非實現=我�主格"}, {"x": 125, "y": 144, "w": 45, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點-去"}, {"x": 171, "y": 144, "w": 45, "h": 7, "text": "販賣-關係詞"}, {"x": 217, "y": 144, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "菜"}, {"x": 73, "y": 156, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "te=ku"}, {"x": 132, "y": 156, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "pu’a"}, {"x": 178, "y": 156, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "vutúkuru"}, {"x": 73, "y": 165, "w": 49, "h": 7, "text": "非實現=我�主格"}, {"x": 125, "y": 165, "w": 45, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點�買"}, {"x": 171, "y": 165, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "魚"}, {"x": 73, "y": 178, "w": 78, "h": 6, "text": "我要去菜市場；我要買魚。"}, {"x": 57, "y": 193, "w": 216, "h": 7, "text": "（12-1a）是標準的連動結構，兩個動詞串連，共同組成的單一謂語，講的"}, {"x": 47, "y": 205, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "是單一事件：「我要去菜市場買魚」。（12-1a）裡的兩個動詞在非連動結構時，"}, {"x": 47, "y": 217, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "均可單獨成為獨立的謂語，如（12-1b）。不同於（12-1a），（12-1b）則是交代兩"}, {"x": 47, "y": 229, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "個事件，一是說明「我要去菜市場」，二是說明「我要買魚」，這兩個動詞前後"}, {"x": 47, "y": 241, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "順序可以顛倒，顛倒之後說的還是兩個事件，「我要買魚」以及「我要去菜市"}, {"x": 47, "y": 253, "w": 116, "h": 6, "text": "場」，可是（12-1a）強調的是單一事件。"}, {"x": 60, "y": 271, "w": 212, "h": 7, "text": "當連動結構的第一個動詞帶否定詞時，如（12-2a）所示，說的是「我不要"}, {"x": 47, "y": 283, "w": 225, "h": 7, "text": "去菜市場買魚」，否定單一事件。而在非連動結構（12-2b）則是兩句的動詞均"}, {"x": 47, "y": 295, "w": 225, "h": 6, "text": "可接否定詞，說的是「我不要去菜市場；我不要買魚」，否定兩個事件，且在兩"}, {"x": 47, "y": 307, "w": 78, "h": 6, "text": "句當中，經常伴隨著停頓。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 325, "w": 172, "h": 7, "text": "（12-2）a�ka’anʉku tia múkusa tamia’aa camai pu’a vutuukuru�"}, {"x": 72, "y": 337, "w": 32, "h": 7, "text": "ka’anʉ=ku"}, {"x": 125, "y": 337, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "tia"}, {"x": 151, "y": 337, "w": 28, "h": 7, "text": "m-ukusa"}, {"x": 197, "y": 337, "w": 24, "h": 7, "text": "tamia’aa"}, {"x": 72, "y": 346, "w": 117, "h": 7, "text": "否定詞=我�主格非實現主事焦點�去"}, {"x": 191, "y": 346, "w": 44, "h": 7, "text": "販賣-關係詞"}, {"x": 73, "y": 358, "w": 19, "h": 7, "text": "camai"}, {"x": 99, "y": 358, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "pu’a"}, {"x": 145, "y": 358, "w": 27, "h": 7, "text": "vutuukuru"}, {"x": 73, "y": 367, "w": 8, "h": 7, "text": "菜"}, {"x": 93, "y": 367, "w": 44, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點�買"}, {"x": 139, "y": 367, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "魚"}, {"x": 73, "y": 380, "w": 65, "h": 6, "text": "我不要去菜市場買魚。"}, {"x": 22, "y": 31, "w": 6, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 19, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 51, "text": "第十二章　連動結構"}, {"x": 20, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "124"}]}
