ext": "三個，表達接續前一事件之後所發生之事件，也可表示「後來、最後」。以下皆"}, {"x": 47, "y": 228, "w": 124, "h": 7, "text": "是由附錄三中的長篇故事節錄出來的例句："}, {"x": 44, "y": 247, "w": 158, "h": 6, "text": "（14-6）marivivini,’apucanʉn cau tarukuka mákari taniarʉ�"}, {"x": 67, "y": 256, "w": 34, "h": 6, "text": "marivivini,"}, {"x": 132, "y": 256, "w": 42, "h": 6, "text": "’apu-ucanʉ-ʉn"}, {"x": 198, "y": 256, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "cau"}, {"x": 217, "y": 256, "w": 25, "h": 6, "text": "tarukuka"}, {"x": 67, "y": 264, "w": 140, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點�跟隨在後使動-走去-受事焦點人"}, {"x": 211, "y": 264, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "雞"}, {"x": 67, "y": 277, "w": 25, "h": 6, "text": "ma-kari"}, {"x": 119, "y": 277, "w": 20, "h": 6, "text": "taniarʉ�"}, {"x": 67, "y": 286, "w": 44, "h": 6, "text": "主事焦點-話語"}, {"x": 113, "y": 286, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "太陽"}, {"x": 67, "y": 298, "w": 169, "h": 6, "text": "最後，人類請雞與太陽商量。（節錄自附錄三：射日（94））"}, {"x": 44, "y": 313, "w": 215, "h": 7, "text": "（14-7）niara kee tumatini na nguain tamna vuku�makásua cu, pui’i cu na tanasa�"}, {"x": 66, "y": 322, "w": 32, "h": 7, "text": "ni-ara=kee"}, {"x": 132, "y": 322, "w": 31, "h": 7, "text": "t<um>atini"}, {"x": 184, "y": 322, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "na"}, {"x": 204, "y": 322, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "nguain"}, {"x": 230, "y": 322, "w": 18, "h": 7, "text": "tamna"}, {"x": 256, "y": 322, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "vuku�"}, {"x": 66, "y": 331, "w": 62, "h": 7, "text": "完成貌-拿=他�屬格"}, {"x": 132, "y": 331, "w": 44, "h": 7, "text": "<主事焦點>掛"}, {"x": 178, "y": 331, "w": 68, "h": 7, "text": "處格他�主格屬於"}, {"x": 250, "y": 331, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "腰帶"}, {"x": 66, "y": 344, "w": 38, "h": 6, "text": "makásua=cu,"}, {"x": 119, "y": 344, "w": 24, "h": 6, "text": "pui’i=cu"}, {"x": 165, "y": 344, "w": 8, "h": 6, "text": "na"}, {"x": 178, "y": 344, "w": 18, "h": 6, "text": "tanasa�"}, {"x": 66, "y": 352, "w": 131, "h": 7, "text": "那樣=狀態改變回=狀態改變處格家屋"}, {"x": 66, "y": 365, "w": 207, "h": 6, "text": "他拿起來掛在他的腰帶，之後就回家了。（節錄自附錄三：射日（17）-"}, {"x": 63, "y": 374, "w": 23, 