{"page": 172, "rows": [{"x": 44, "y": 41, "w": 147, "h": 6, "text": "（14-8）aranai’inia cau mavuvuarʉmataa marʉkurapʉ�"}, {"x": 66, "y": 50, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "aranai"}, {"x": 93, "y": 50, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "’inia"}, {"x": 112, "y": 50, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "cau"}, {"x": 132, "y": 50, "w": 34, "h": 6, "text": "mavuvuarʉ"}, {"x": 171, "y": 50, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "mataa"}, {"x": 197, "y": 50, "w": 34, "h": 6, "text": "marʉkurapʉ�"}, {"x": 66, "y": 59, "w": 9, "h": 6, "text": "從"}, {"x": 86, "y": 59, "w": 35, "h": 6, "text": "那裡人"}, {"x": 126, "y": 59, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "分散"}, {"x": 165, "y": 59, "w": 16, "h": 6, "text": "和"}, {"x": 191, "y": 59, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "獸類"}, {"x": 66, "y": 71, "w": 170, "h": 6, "text": "之後，人類與獸類便分開了。（節錄自附錄三：洪水（34））"}, {"x": 47, "y": 87, "w": 60, "h": 8, "text": "14�2�2　條件子句"}, {"x": 60, "y": 100, "w": 213, "h": 7, "text": "這一類的副詞子句，提供一個條件框架，來說明主要事件是發生另一個事"}, {"x": 47, "y": 112, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "件的先決條件。noo「如果」是最常用、最常見的連接詞，通常出現在句首，動"}, {"x": 47, "y": 124, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "詞或助動詞也會伴隨使用依附詞詞綴=in「如果」，同時搭配主題標記ia，形成"}, {"x": 47, "y": 136, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "[noo…in…ia,]，表達「如果」之意，例子如（14-9a）。依附詞=in可省略，僅單"}, {"x": 47, "y": 148, "w": 225, "h": 6, "text": "用noo，如（14-9b），亦可不用noo，單用依附詞=in及主題標記ia如（14-9c）。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 166, "w": 210, "h": 7, "text": "（14-9）a�noo’unain vavuru tamna’anuka ia, kamanʉnga vavuru tamna ringai�"}, {"x": 73, "y": 175, "w": 11, "h": 7, "text": "noo"}, {"x": 93, "y": 175, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "’una=in"}, {"x": 132, "y": 175, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "vavuru"}, {"x": 158, "y": 175, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "tamna"}, {"x": 184, "y": 175, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "’anuka"}, {"x": 210, "y": 175, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "ia"}, {"x": 73, "y": 184, "w": 75, "h": 6, "text": "如果存在=如果山豬"}, {"x": 152, "y": 184, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "屬於"}, {"x": 178, "y": 184, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "獸印"}, {"x": 204, "y": 184, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "主題"}, {"x": 73, "y": 196, "w":