{"page": 173, "rows": [{"x": 44, "y": 41, "w": 188, "h": 6, "text": "（14-10）’apangʉrʉʉn kee nivanga móvua na nguain tamna kinvavara�"}, {"x": 72, "y": 50, "w": 163, "h": 6, "text": "nokaniin vʉʉn ia, manasʉtia móravu nguain tamna kinvavara�"}, {"x": 69, "y": 59, "w": 54, "h": 6, "text": "’apa-ngʉrʉ-ʉn=kee"}, {"x": 165, "y": 59, "w": 24, "h": 6, "text": "nivanga"}, {"x": 197, "y": 59, "w": 24, "h": 6, "text": "mo-vua"}, {"x": 243, "y": 59, "w": 8, "h": 6, "text": "na"}, {"x": 69, "y": 67, "w": 112, "h": 7, "text": "使動-分半-受事焦點=他�屬格香蕉"}, {"x": 191, "y": 67, "w": 44, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點-給"}, {"x": 237, "y": 67, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "處格"}, {"x": 69, "y": 80, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "nguain"}, {"x": 99, "y": 80, "w": 18, "h": 6, "text": "tamna"}, {"x": 125, "y": 80, "w": 32, "h": 6, "text": "kin-va-vara"}, {"x": 184, "y": 80, "w": 40, "h": 6, "text": "noo=ka’anʉ=in"}, {"x": 69, "y": 89, "w": 45, "h": 6, "text": "他�主格屬於"}, {"x": 119, "y": 89, "w": 55, "h": 6, "text": "關係-重疊-手足"}, {"x": 178, "y": 89, "w": 63, "h": 6, "text": "如果=否定詞=如果"}, {"x": 69, "y": 101, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "vua-ʉn"}, {"x": 112, "y": 101, "w": 9, "h": 6, "text": "ia"}, {"x": 132, "y": 101, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "manasʉ"}, {"x": 165, "y": 101, "w": 9, "h": 6, "text": "tia"}, {"x": 191, "y": 101, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "móravu"}, {"x": 243, "y": 101, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "nguain"}, {"x": 69, "y": 110, "w": 79, "h": 6, "text": "給-受事焦點主題或許"}, {"x": 158, "y": 110, "w": 77, "h": 6, "text": "非實現主事焦點�飢餓"}, {"x": 237, "y": 110, "w": 32, "h": 6, "text": "他�主格"}, {"x": 69, "y": 122, "w": 19, "h": 7, "text": "tamna"}, {"x": 93, "y": 122, "w": 30, "h": 7, "text": "kin-va-vara"}, {"x": 69, "y": 131, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "屬於"}, {"x": 86, "y": 131, "w": 54, "h": 7, "text": "關係-重疊-手足"}, {"x": 69, "y": 143, "w": 205, "h": 7, "text": "他把香蕉分半給他的兄弟姊妹。假如不分的話，或許兄弟姐妹會肚子餓。"}, {"x": 60, "y": 162, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "在有時間框架的上下文中，noo也常轉而表達「當」或「之後」，如下面例"}, {"x": 47, "y": 174, "w": 26, "h": 6, "text":