{"page": 175, "rows": [{"x": 70, "y": 41, "w": 169, "h": 6, "text": "d�vanai tia’apacangcangarʉʉn’aree, paracani mataa’utori Piori�"}, {"x": 76, "y": 50, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "vanai"}, {"x": 99, "y": 50, "w": 9, "h": 6, "text": "tia"}, {"x": 125, "y": 50, "w": 57, "h": 6, "text": "’apa-cangcangarʉ-ʉn"}, {"x": 191, "y": 50, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "’aree"}, {"x": 217, "y": 50, "w": 24, "h": 6, "text": "paracani"}, {"x": 250, "y": 50, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "mataa"}, {"x": 76, "y": 59, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "原因"}, {"x": 93, "y": 59, "w": 112, "h": 6, "text": "非實現使動-快樂-受事焦點人名"}, {"x": 210, "y": 59, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "唱歌"}, {"x": 243, "y": 59, "w": 13, "h": 6, "text": "和"}, {"x": 76, "y": 71, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "’utori"}, {"x": 99, "y": 71, "w": 13, "h": 6, "text": "Piori"}, {"x": 76, "y": 80, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "跳舞"}, {"x": 93, "y": 80, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "人名"}, {"x": 76, "y": 92, "w": 106, "h": 7, "text": "為了讓’aree開心，Piori唱歌又跳舞。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 108, "w": 195, "h": 6, "text": "（14-14）patimanʉngoo musʉ’ʉvántuku musu; masii ka’anʉko’uʉn cau�"}, {"x": 70, "y": 117, "w": 45, "h": 6, "text": "pati-manʉngʉ-o"}, {"x": 145, "y": 117, "w": 25, "h": 6, "text": "m-usʉ’ʉ"}, {"x": 197, "y": 117, "w": 41, "h": 6, "text": "vántuku=musu"}, {"x": 70, "y": 125, "w": 120, "h": 7, "text": "PATI-好-祈使�受事焦點主事焦點-放置"}, {"x": 191, "y": 125, "w": 43, "h": 7, "text": "錢=你�屬格"}, {"x": 70, "y": 138, "w": 18, "h": 6, "text": "masii"}, {"x": 93, "y": 138, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "ka’anʉ"}, {"x": 119, "y": 138, "w": 28, "h": 6, "text": "ko’ua-ʉn"}, {"x": 165, "y": 138, "w": 9, "h": 6, "text": "cau"}, {"x": 70, "y": 147, "w": 8, "h": 6, "text": "才"}, {"x": 86, "y": 147, "w": 71, "h": 6, "text": "否定詞偷-受事焦點"}, {"x": 158, "y": 147, "w": 13, "h": 6, "text": "人"}, {"x": 70, "y": 159, "w": 98, "h": 6, "text": "把你的錢放好，別人才不會偷走。"}, {"x": 60, "y": 175, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "ímua「所以、因此」常出現長篇故事中，表示一種承接前句的上下文章因"}, {"x": 47, "y": 186, "w": 59, "h": 7, "text": "果關係，範例如下："}, 