{"page": 187, "rows": [{"x": 47, "y": 40, "w": 185, "h": 14, "text": "附錄一　族語標點符號及範例"}, {"x": 50, "y": 80, "w": 10, "h": 5, "text": "編號"}, {"x": 65, "y": 76, "w": 16, "h": 6, "text": "標點符"}, {"x": 65, "y": 83, "w": 16, "h": 6, "text": "號名稱"}, {"x": 85, "y": 73, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "族語標點"}, {"x": 90, "y": 80, "w": 11, "h": 5, "text": "符號"}, {"x": 85, "y": 87, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "（半形）"}, {"x": 110, "y": 73, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "對應中文"}, {"x": 110, "y": 80, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "標點符號"}, {"x": 110, "y": 87, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "（全形）"}, {"x": 161, "y": 80, "w": 11, "h": 5, "text": "說明"}, {"x": 215, "y": 80, "w": 42, "h": 5, "text": "卡那卡那富語範例"}, {"x": 54, "y": 104, "w": 2, "h": 5, "text": "1"}, {"x": 67, "y": 104, "w": 11, "h": 5, "text": "句號"}, {"x": 95, "y": 104, "w": 1, "h": 5, "text": "�"}, {"x": 118, "y": 104, "w": 5, "h": 5, "text": "。"}, {"x": 135, "y": 97, "w": 53, "h": 5, "text": "用於一個語義完整的句"}, {"x": 135, "y": 104, "w": 59, "h": 5, "text": "末，但不用於疑問句或感"}, {"x": 135, "y": 110, "w": 16, "h": 6, "text": "嘆句。"}, {"x": 202, "y": 97, "w": 53, "h": 6, "text": "sua tanasʉn maku ia’esi"}, {"x": 202, "y": 104, "w": 20, "h": 5, "text": "Namásia�"}, {"x": 202, "y": 110, "w": 48, "h": 6, "text": "我的故鄉在那瑪夏。"}, {"x": 54, "y": 258, "w": 2, "h": 5, "text": "2"}, {"x": 67, "y": 258, "w": 11, "h": 5, "text": "逗號"}, {"x": 95, "y": 258, "w": 1, "h": 5, "text": ","}, {"x": 118, "y": 166, "w": 5, "h": 5, "text": "、"}, {"x": 132, "y": 162, "w": 62, "h": 6, "text": "（1）用來分開具同等地位"}, {"x": 146, "y": 169, "w": 32, "h": 5, "text": "之詞或詞組。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 122, "w": 63, "h": 12, "text": "詞：（a）Mu’u, Pa’ʉmataa Kuatʉ"}, {"x": 210, "y": 135, "w": 47, "h": 6, "text": "tia múkusa‘umó’uma"}, {"x": 210, "y": 142, "w": 24, "h": 5, "text": "marivina’ʉ�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 148, "w": 57, "h": 6, "text": "Mu’u、Pa’ʉ跟Kuatʉ要去"}, {"x": 210, "y": 155, "w": 37, "h": 5, "text": "田裡收割小米。"}, {"x": 202, "y": 163, "w": 15, "h": 5, "text": "詞組："}, {"x": 199, "y": 170, "w": 68, "h": 5, "text": "（b）neni tamna tikuru isa?’una"}, {"x": 210, "y": 176, "w": 54, "h": 6, "text": "tamna tikuru,’avia tamna"}, {"x": 210, "y": 183, "w": 60, "h": 5, "text": "sapániri mataa’apu’u tamna"}, {"x": 210, "y": 189, "w": 32, "h": 6, "text": "kapaang sinatʉ�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 196, "w": 57, "h": 5, "text": "那些東西是誰的？是’una"}, {"x": 210, "y": 202, "w": 48, "h": 6, "text": "的衣服、’avia的鞋子"}, {"x": 210, "y": 209, "w": 41, "h": 5, "text": "和’apu’u的書包。"}, {"x": 118, "y": 227, "w": 5, "h": 6, "text": "："}, {"x": 132, "y": 224, "w": 65, "h": 6, "text": "（2）用於直接引用的句子之"}, {"x": 145, "y": 231, "w": 11, "h": 5, "text": "前。"}, {"x": 202, "y": 221, "w": 58, "h": 5, "text": "makasi cuma maku,“’akuni"}, {"x": 202, "y": 227, "w": 31, "h": 6, "text": "múkusa’inia!”�"}, {"x": 202, "y": 234, "w": 68, "h": 5, "text": "我爸爸說：「不要去那裡！」。"}, {"x": 118, "y": 320, "w": 5, "h": 5, "text": "，"}, {"x": 132, "y": 267, "w": 66, "h": 5, "text": "（3）用於隔開複雜句內各分"}, {"x": 146, "y": 273, "w": 52, "h": 5, "text": "句，或標示句子內語氣"}, {"x": 146, "y": 280, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "的停頓。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 246, "w": 66, "h": 6, "text": "（a）sua isi ia tanʉkʉ, sua isa ia"}, {"x": 210, "y": 253, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "tammi�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 259, "w": 52, "h": 5, "text": "這是芋頭，那是甘藷。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 267, "w": 65, "h": 6, "text": "（b）’esi makananguru’akori,"}, {"x": 210, "y": 274, "w": 60, "h": 5, "text": "’esi sumasapuarʉsua’angai,"}, {"x": 210, "y": 280, "w": 51, "h": 6, "text": "’esi si’icʉpʉna vatu sua"}, {"x": 210, "y": 287, "w": 11, "h": 5, "text": "’upa�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 293, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "’akori在游泳，’angai在射"}, {"x": 210, "y": 300, "w": 57, "h": 5, "text": "魚，’upa在石頭上睡覺。"}, {"x": 132, "y": 340, "w": 66, "h": 5, "text": "（4）用於「主題標記」ia之"}, {"x": 146, "y": 346, "w": 52, "h": 6, "text": "後，逗號可以出現，"}, {"x": 146, "y": 353, "w": 52, "h": 5, "text": "也可以不出現；通常"}, {"x": 146, "y": 359, "w": 52, "h": 6, "text": "ia前的句子較長時逗"}, {"x": 146, "y": 366, "w": 26, "h": 5, "text": "號會出現。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 312, "w": 61, "h": 5, "text": "（a）sua Saupu ia Kai tamna"}, {"x": 210, "y": 319, "w": 13, "h": 5, "text": "cuma�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 325, "w": 49, "h": 5, "text": "Saupu是Kai的爸爸。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 333, "w": 68, "h": 6, "text": "（b）tuku makuísua ia siniruvai"}, {"x": 210, "y": 340, "w": 52, "h": 5, "text": "Kini, koo pa nguain’ai’i"}, {"x": 210, "y": 346, "w": 12, "h": 6, "text": "’ikua�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 353, "w": 57, "h": 5, "text": "我那把鋤頭啊，Kini借走"}, {"x": 210, "y": 359, "w": 53, "h": 6, "text": "了，他還沒拿來還我。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 368, "w": 69, "h": 5, "text": "（c）tuku makuísua ia, siniruvai"}, {"x": 210, "y": 374, "w": 52, "h": 6, "text": "Kini, koo pa nguain’ai’i"}, {"x": 210, "y": 381, "w": 12, "h": 5, "text": "’ikua�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 387, "w": 57, "h": 6, "text": "我那把鋤頭啊，Kini借走"}, {"x": 210, "y": 394, "w": 46, "h": 5, "text": "了，他還沒拿來還。"}, {"x": 293, "y": 31, "w": 5, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 290, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 74, "text": "附錄一　族語標點符號及範例"}, {"x": 290, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "163"}]}
{"page": 188, "rows": [{"x": 50, "y": 50, "w": 10, "h": 6, "text": "編號"}, {"x": 65, "y": 47, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "標點符"}, {"x": 65, "y": 54, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "號名稱"}, {"x": 85, "y": 43, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "族語標點"}, {"x": 90, "y": 50, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "符號"}, {"x": 85, "y": 57, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "（半形）"}, {"x": 110, "y": 43, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "對應中文"}, {"x": 110, "y": 50, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "標點符號"}, {"x": 110, "y": 57, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "（全形）"}, {"x": 161, "y": 50, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "說明"}, {"x": 215, "y": 50, "w": 42, "h": 6, "text": "卡那卡那富語範例"}, {"x": 54, "y": 199, "w": 2, "h": 6, "text": "3"}, {"x": 67, "y": 199, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "分號"}, {"x": 95, "y": 199, "w": 1, "h": 6, "text": ";"}, {"x": 118, "y": 169, "w": 5, "h": 5, "text": "，"}, {"x": 118, "y": 183, "w": 5, "h": 6, "text": "；"}, {"x": 132, "y": 147, "w": 66, "h": 5, "text": "（1）用於分隔地位平等的"}, {"x": 146, "y": 153, "w": 52, "h": 6, "text": "獨立子句。不同於句"}, {"x": 146, "y": 160, "w": 52, "h": 5, "text": "點，使用分號常標示"}, {"x": 146, "y": 166, "w": 52, "h": 6, "text": "子句之間有某種不明"}, {"x": 146, "y": 173, "w": 52, "h": 5, "text": "示的關係，如「條"}, {"x": 146, "y": 179, "w": 52, "h": 6, "text": "件」、「對比」、「因"}, {"x": 146, "y": 186, "w": 52, "h": 5, "text": "果」等，這種關係有"}, {"x": 146, "y": 192, "w": 52, "h": 6, "text": "時可由上下文得知，"}, {"x": 146, "y": 199, "w": 52, "h": 5, "text": "有時亦可由附加的連"}, {"x": 146, "y": 206, "w": 26, "h": 5, "text": "接詞表之。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 67, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "（a）patimanʉngoo musʉ’ʉ"}, {"x": 210, "y": 74, "w": 53, "h": 5, "text": "vántuku musu; tia ko’uʉn"}, {"x": 210, "y": 81, "w": 62, "h": 11, "text": "cau�把你的錢放好；別人會偷。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 95, "w": 59, "h": 6, "text": "（b）patimanʉngʉo musʉ’ʉ"}, {"x": 210, "y": 102, "w": 59, "h": 5, "text": "vántuku musu; masii ka’an"}, {"x": 210, "y": 108, "w": 26, "h": 6, "text": "ko’uʉn cau�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 115, "w": 58, "h": 5, "text": "把你的錢放好，別人才不"}, {"x": 210, "y": 121, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "會偷走。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 130, "w": 55, "h": 5, "text": "（c）’itúmuru Kiua tamna"}, {"x": 210, "y": 136, "w": 60, "h": 6, "text": "vántuku; na’ángici pa nguain�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 143, "w": 58, "h": 5, "text": "Kiua很多錢；他還是很吝"}, {"x": 210, "y": 149, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "嗇。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 157, "w": 55, "h": 6, "text": "（d）’itúmuru Kiua tamna"}, {"x": 210, "y": 164, "w": 57, "h": 5, "text": "vántuku; nakai na’ángici pa"}, {"x": 210, "y": 170, "w": 17, "h": 6, "text": "nguain�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 177, "w": 58, "h": 5, "text": "Kiua很多錢，但他還是很"}, {"x": 210, "y": 184, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "吝嗇。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 192, "w": 59, "h": 5, "text": "（e）’itúmuru na cakʉran isi"}, {"x": 210, "y": 198, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "vutúkuru; ka’anʉtarasangai"}, {"x": 210, "y": 205, "w": 55, "h": 5, "text": "na sikara vatu takuvarívari"}, {"x": 210, "y": 211, "w": 41, "h": 6, "text": "kumakʉnʉkunamʉ�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 218, "w": 58, "h": 5, "text": "這條河有很多魚；魚兒在"}, {"x": 210, "y": 224, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "河裡的石頭上不停地翻滾"}, {"x": 210, "y": 231, "w": 32, "h": 5, "text": "著啃食川苔。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 239, "w": 59, "h": 6, "text": "（f）’itúmuru na cakʉran isi"}, {"x": 210, "y": 246, "w": 48, "h": 5, "text": "vutúkuru,ímua ka’anʉ"}, {"x": 210, "y": 252, "w": 51, "h": 6, "text": "tarasangai na sikara vatu"}, {"x": 210, "y": 259, "w": 49, "h": 5, "text": "takuvarívari kumakʉnʉ"}, {"x": 210, "y": 265, "w": 18, "h": 6, "text": "kunamʉ�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 272, "w": 58, "h": 5, "text": "這條河有很多魚，所以魚"}, {"x": 210, "y": 278, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "兒在河裡的石頭上不停地"}, {"x": 210, "y": 285, "w": 42, "h": 5, "text": "翻滾著啃食川苔。"}, {"x": 118, "y": 314, "w": 5, "h": 5, "text": "；"}, {"x": 132, "y": 311, "w": 62, "h": 5, "text": "（2）用分號來附加說明前"}, {"x": 146, "y": 317, "w": 32, "h": 6, "text": "一句之內容。"}, {"x": 202, "y": 297, "w": 60, "h": 5, "text": "niatʉnʉsʉmaku na cacanʉia"}, {"x": 202, "y": 303, "w": 57, "h": 6, "text": "Kuatʉ, Rangui mataa Na’u;"}, {"x": 202, "y": 310, "w": 47, "h": 5, "text": "ka’anʉPaicʉmata Pi’i�"}, {"x": 202, "y": 318, "w": 60, "h": 6, "text": "我在路上遇見的是Kuatʉ、"}, {"x": 202, "y": 325, "w": 65, "h": 5, "text": "Rangui和Na’u；不是Paicʉ和"}, {"x": 202, "y": 331, "w": 12, "h": 6, "text": "Pi’i。"}, {"x": 54, "y": 374, "w": 2, "h": 5, "text": "4"}, {"x": 67, "y": 374, "w": 11, "h": 5, "text": "引號"}, {"x": 92, "y": 374, "w": 7, "h": 5, "text": "“”"}, {"x": 115, "y": 374, "w": 11, "h": 5, "text": "「」"}, {"x": 135, "y": 367, "w": 59, "h": 5, "text": "用於標示某人所說的話、"}, {"x": 135, "y": 374, "w": 59, "h": 5, "text": "引述、特別指稱或強調的"}, {"x": 135, "y": 380, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "詞語。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 343, "w": 72, "h": 6, "text": "（a）“ka’anʉku tia múkusa tanasa"}, {"x": 210, "y": 350, "w": 52, "h": 5, "text": "’usu sumasima’ʉ”misee"}, {"x": 210, "y": 356, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "’uva�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 363, "w": 59, "h": 5, "text": "’uva說：「我不要去’usu家"}, {"x": 210, "y": 369, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "玩。」"}, {"x": 199, "y": 378, "w": 68, "h": 5, "text": "（b）maka’uarʉkitana nikianara"}, {"x": 210, "y": 384, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "mamarang makasi,“uranoo"}, {"x": 210, "y": 391, "w": 45, "h": 5, "text": "sua muru’inasʉcau�”"}, {"x": 210, "y": 397, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "我們的祖先訓示我們說："}, {"x": 208, "y": 404, "w": 56, "h": 5, "text": "「要去幫助困苦的人。」"}, {"x": 22, "y": 31, "w": 6, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 19, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 74, "text": "附錄一　族語標點符號及範例"}, {"x": 20, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "164"}]}
{"page": 189, "rows": [{"x": 50, "y": 50, "w": 10, "h": 6, "text": "編號"}, {"x": 65, "y": 47, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "標點符"}, {"x": 65, "y": 54, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "號名稱"}, {"x": 85, "y": 43, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "族語標點"}, {"x": 90, "y": 50, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "符號"}, {"x": 85, "y": 57, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "（半形）"}, {"x": 110, "y": 43, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "對應中文"}, {"x": 110, "y": 50, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "標點符號"}, {"x": 110, "y": 57, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "（全形）"}, {"x": 161, "y": 50, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "說明"}, {"x": 215, "y": 50, "w": 42, "h": 6, "text": "卡那卡那富語範例"}, {"x": 54, "y": 111, "w": 2, "h": 5, "text": "5"}, {"x": 67, "y": 111, "w": 11, "h": 5, "text": "括號"}, {"x": 93, "y": 111, "w": 5, "h": 5, "text": "( )"}, {"x": 115, "y": 111, "w": 12, "h": 5, "text": "（）"}, {"x": 135, "y": 107, "w": 59, "h": 6, "text": "用於句子中加入評論或解"}, {"x": 135, "y": 114, "w": 11, "h": 5, "text": "釋。"}, {"x": 202, "y": 67, "w": 66, "h": 6, "text": "mama’ari pa, sii’esi pa mamane"}, {"x": 202, "y": 74, "w": 56, "h": 5, "text": "meesua tamu sarunai, tamu"}, {"x": 202, "y": 80, "w": 70, "h": 6, "text": "nanakʉmataa tee cuma vuravurau"}, {"x": 202, "y": 87, "w": 64, "h": 6, "text": "cina maku,ímua tavara’ʉpa ku"}, {"x": 202, "y": 94, "w": 61, "h": 5, "text": "ti’ingi nipaka’uara mamarang"}, {"x": 202, "y": 100, "w": 62, "h": 5, "text": "Kanakanavu（nakai koo pa ku"}, {"x": 202, "y": 107, "w": 60, "h": 5, "text": "cinimʉ’ʉra sinatʉpoísua kari"}, {"x": 202, "y": 113, "w": 26, "h": 5, "text": "mamarang）�"}, {"x": 202, "y": 121, "w": 69, "h": 6, "text": "還好，因為當時我的祖父、祖"}, {"x": 202, "y": 128, "w": 69, "h": 5, "text": "母和我媽媽的叔叔們都還健"}, {"x": 202, "y": 134, "w": 69, "h": 6, "text": "在，所以我對卡那卡那富族的"}, {"x": 202, "y": 141, "w": 69, "h": 5, "text": "祖訓還知道一點（可是我沒見"}, {"x": 202, "y": 147, "w": 69, "h": 6, "text": "過關於卡那卡那富族祖訓的書"}, {"x": 202, "y": 154, "w": 13, "h": 5, "text": "籍）。"}, {"x": 54, "y": 190, "w": 3, "h": 5, "text": "6"}, {"x": 68, "y": 190, "w": 10, "h": 5, "text": "問號"}, {"x": 94, "y": 190, "w": 3, "h": 5, "text": "?"}, {"x": 118, "y": 190, "w": 6, "h": 5, "text": "？"}, {"x": 135, "y": 190, "w": 38, "h": 5, "text": "用於問句句末。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 166, "w": 55, "h": 5, "text": "（a）tia kara kasu múkusa"}, {"x": 211, "y": 173, "w": 32, "h": 5, "text": "Kausiung nura?"}, {"x": 210, "y": 179, "w": 47, "h": 6, "text": "你明天要去高雄嗎？"}, {"x": 199, "y": 187, "w": 57, "h": 6, "text": "（b）te kasu múkusa nanu?"}, {"x": 210, "y": 194, "w": 49, "h": 5, "text": "tavara’ʉkara ku kipapa"}, {"x": 210, "y": 200, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "kasua?"}, {"x": 210, "y": 207, "w": 57, "h": 5, "text": "你要去哪裡？我可以跟你"}, {"x": 210, "y": 214, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "去嗎？"}, {"x": 54, "y": 309, "w": 2, "h": 5, "text": "7"}, {"x": 65, "y": 309, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "驚嘆號"}, {"x": 95, "y": 309, "w": 1, "h": 5, "text": "!"}, {"x": 118, "y": 309, "w": 5, "h": 5, "text": "！"}, {"x": 135, "y": 299, "w": 59, "h": 6, "text": "用於表示感嘆、命令、讚"}, {"x": 135, "y": 306, "w": 59, "h": 5, "text": "美、高興、憤怒、驚訝、"}, {"x": 135, "y": 312, "w": 59, "h": 6, "text": "警告等強烈情感，及加重"}, {"x": 135, "y": 319, "w": 48, "h": 5, "text": "語氣的詞、句之後。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 226, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "「感嘆」"}, {"x": 199, "y": 232, "w": 65, "h": 6, "text": "（a）’ai! ka’anʉpa mamanʉng"}, {"x": 210, "y": 239, "w": 41, "h": 5, "text": "sukʉma cina maku�"}, {"x": 210, "y": 245, "w": 57, "h": 6, "text": "唉！我媽媽的病還沒好。"}, {"x": 199, "y": 253, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "「命令」"}, {"x": 199, "y": 260, "w": 29, "h": 5, "text": "（b）mucana!"}, {"x": 210, "y": 266, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "走開吧！"}, {"x": 199, "y": 275, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "「讚美」"}, {"x": 199, "y": 281, "w": 55, "h": 6, "text": "（c）cucúrana mamanʉng"}, {"x": 210, "y": 288, "w": 32, "h": 5, "text": "cʉpʉngʉPani!"}, {"x": 210, "y": 294, "w": 51, "h": 6, "text": "Pani的心腸真的很好！"}, {"x": 199, "y": 302, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "「高興」"}, {"x": 199, "y": 309, "w": 68, "h": 5, "text": "（d）’itumuruana vántuku maku!"}, {"x": 210, "y": 316, "w": 38, "h": 5, "text": "我的錢真多呀！"}, {"x": 199, "y": 324, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "「憤怒」"}, {"x": 199, "y": 330, "w": 57, "h": 6, "text": "（e）miseni kasu makásua!"}, {"x": 210, "y": 337, "w": 48, "h": 5, "text": "cucuruana kasu natutu!"}, {"x": 210, "y": 343, "w": 57, "h": 6, "text": "你怎麼那樣！你真是頑皮"}, {"x": 210, "y": 350, "w": 11, "h": 5, "text": "啊！"}, {"x": 199, "y": 358, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "「驚訝」"}, {"x": 199, "y": 365, "w": 55, "h": 5, "text": "（f）niaraka kani cauísua!"}, {"x": 210, "y": 371, "w": 47, "h": 5, "text": "聽說那個人過世了！"}, {"x": 199, "y": 379, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "「警告」"}, {"x": 199, "y": 386, "w": 49, "h": 5, "text": "（g）karapa’ician kasu!"}, {"x": 210, "y": 392, "w": 47, "h": 6, "text": "你（再）喝酒看看！"}, {"x": 293, "y": 31, "w": 5, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 290, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 74, "text": "附錄一　族語標點符號及範例"}, {"x": 290, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "165"}]}
{"page": 190, "rows": [{"x": 50, "y": 50, "w": 10, "h": 6, "text": "編號"}, {"x": 65, "y": 47, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "標點符"}, {"x": 65, "y": 54, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "號名稱"}, {"x": 85, "y": 43, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "族語標點"}, {"x": 90, "y": 50, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "符號"}, {"x": 85, "y": 57, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "（半形）"}, {"x": 110, "y": 43, "w": 21, "h": 5, "text": "對應中文"}, {"x": 110, "y": 50, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "標點符號"}, {"x": 110, "y": 57, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "（全形）"}, {"x": 161, "y": 50, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "說明"}, {"x": 215, "y": 50, "w": 42, "h": 6, "text": "卡那卡那富語範例"}, {"x": 54, "y": 112, "w": 2, "h": 6, "text": "8"}, {"x": 65, "y": 112, "w": 16, "h": 6, "text": "破折號"}, {"x": 94, "y": 112, "w": 3, "h": 6, "text": "--"}, {"x": 117, "y": 112, "w": 8, "h": 6, "text": "―"}, {"x": 132, "y": 90, "w": 56, "h": 5, "text": "（1）用在進一步說明。"}, {"x": 202, "y": 67, "w": 63, "h": 6, "text": "’akuni arakukunu mataa Pani"}, {"x": 202, "y": 75, "w": 69, "h": 5, "text": "sumasima’ʉ--nguai sua napá’ici"}, {"x": 202, "y": 82, "w": 67, "h": 5, "text": "tamna manu Pani�paira nguain"}, {"x": 202, "y": 89, "w": 36, "h": 5, "text": "arasurutu na cau�"}, {"x": 202, "y": 98, "w": 69, "h": 5, "text": "不要跟Pani一起玩―就是那"}, {"x": 202, "y": 105, "w": 69, "h": 5, "text": "位酒鬼的兒子Pani。他待人經"}, {"x": 202, "y": 112, "w": 37, "h": 5, "text": "常會惱羞成怒。"}, {"x": 132, "y": 141, "w": 40, "h": 5, "text": "（2）用以舉例。"}, {"x": 202, "y": 124, "w": 64, "h": 5, "text": "A: neni nikó’ua niparia Paicʉ"}, {"x": 208, "y": 131, "w": 32, "h": 6, "text": "’aramʉmaku?"}, {"x": 202, "y": 140, "w": 66, "h": 5, "text": "B: ikim--’atai,’apio mataa iku�"}, {"x": 202, "y": 149, "w": 65, "h": 5, "text": "A：誰偷了Paicʉ所曬的肉？"}, {"x": 202, "y": 157, "w": 68, "h": 6, "text": "B：我們―’atai、’apio和我。"}, {"x": 54, "y": 216, "w": 2, "h": 6, "text": "9"}, {"x": 65, "y": 216, "w": 16, "h": 6, "text": "刪節號"}, {"x": 93, "y": 216, "w": 5, "h": 6, "text": "���"}, {"x": 118, "y": 216, "w": 5, "h": 6, "text": "…"}, {"x": 132, "y": 192, "w": 62, "h": 5, "text": "（1）用在述說未完，還有"}, {"x": 146, "y": 199, "w": 32, "h": 5, "text": "例子未舉出。"}, {"x": 202, "y": 170, "w": 51, "h": 5, "text": "niarakukunu kim miʉra"}, {"x": 202, "y": 177, "w": 44, "h": 5, "text": "aracakanʉ�’itúmuru"}, {"x": 202, "y": 184, "w": 70, "h": 5, "text": "niaracakana mia, makai ngʉkau,"}, {"x": 202, "y": 191, "w": 56, "h": 5, "text": "to’urung, takuisi mataa…"}, {"x": 202, "y": 198, "w": 46, "h": 6, "text": "cucuruana’una’incu!"}, {"x": 202, "y": 207, "w": 64, "h": 5, "text": "昨天我們一起去打獵，獵到"}, {"x": 202, "y": 214, "w": 64, "h": 5, "text": "很多獵物，像猴子、山羌、"}, {"x": 202, "y": 221, "w": 48, "h": 5, "text": "山羊和…真幸運啊！"}, {"x": 132, "y": 245, "w": 62, "h": 5, "text": "（2）用在述說未完或述說"}, {"x": 146, "y": 252, "w": 48, "h": 5, "text": "不清楚、語帶含糊。"}, {"x": 202, "y": 233, "w": 68, "h": 6, "text": "matárava masini koo pa nguain"}, {"x": 202, "y": 240, "w": 67, "h": 6, "text": "makacʉkʉna�ka’anʉtavara’ʉn"}, {"x": 202, "y": 247, "w": 45, "h": 6, "text": "…’aa!’esacu nguain�"}, {"x": 202, "y": 256, "w": 64, "h": 6, "text": "他到現在還沒到，不知道…"}, {"x": 202, "y": 263, "w": 37, "h": 6, "text": "哦！他來了啦。"}, {"x": 52, "y": 294, "w": 6, "h": 5, "text": "10"}, {"x": 65, "y": 294, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "連結號"}, {"x": 94, "y": 294, "w": 3, "h": 5, "text": "-"}, {"x": 118, "y": 294, "w": 5, "h": 5, "text": "無"}, {"x": 135, "y": 291, "w": 59, "h": 5, "text": "用於歌曲中，分解歌詞配"}, {"x": 135, "y": 298, "w": 32, "h": 5, "text": "合樂譜需求。"}, {"x": 202, "y": 275, "w": 64, "h": 6, "text": "ma-ti-’ara-’a-ra-vang’aa’ara-"}, {"x": 202, "y": 283, "w": 64, "h": 5, "text": "vang va-tu’ara-vang va-tu! ti-"}, {"x": 202, "y": 290, "w": 38, "h": 5, "text": "sa-’ʉku-’a-pa-sʉ�"}, {"x": 202, "y": 299, "w": 64, "h": 5, "text": "石縫裡摸、摸、摸，石縫裡"}, {"x": 202, "y": 306, "w": 64, "h": 5, "text": "摸、摸、摸啊！啊！抓到螃"}, {"x": 202, "y": 313, "w": 10, "h": 5, "text": "蟹。"}, {"x": 22, "y": 31, "w": 6, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 19, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 74, "text": "附錄一　族語標點符號及範例"}, {"x": 20, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "166"}]}
{"page": 191, "rows": [{"x": 49, "y": 49, "w": 16, "h": 5, "text": "其他："}, {"x": 49, "y": 58, "w": 165, "h": 5, "text": "一、族語標點符號打字時，字體採用Times New Roman，並使用半形。"}, {"x": 49, "y": 67, "w": 120, "h": 5, "text": "二、有關逗號之使用，勿受中文影響「一逗到底」。"}, {"x": 49, "y": 76, "w": 75, "h": 5, "text": "三、有關引號之使用，宜注意："}, {"x": 60, "y": 84, "w": 85, "h": 6, "text": "1�不用單引號，以避免與喉塞音混淆"}, {"x": 60, "y": 93, "w": 208, "h": 6, "text": "2�「引號」與「逗號」連用，「引號」不與「冒號」連用，因部份其他語言以「冒號」標示"}, {"x": 66, "y": 102, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "長音"}, {"x": 60, "y": 111, "w": 85, "h": 6, "text": "3�引文的句尾標點符號標在引號之內"}, {"x": 49, "y": 129, "w": 131, "h": 5, "text": "四、刪節號為3點；但刪節號出現於句尾時以4點標示。"}, {"x": 49, "y": 138, "w": 123, "h": 5, "text": "五、所有標點符號之後均空一格，惟下列情形例外："}, {"x": 60, "y": 147, "w": 91, "h": 5, "text": "1�引號與引文的句尾標點符號間不留空"}, {"x": 60, "y": 156, "w": 69, "h": 5, "text": "2�破折號與連結號前後不留空"}, {"x": 60, "y": 165, "w": 64, "h": 5, "text": "3�括號與括號內文間不留空"}, {"x": 49, "y": 182, "w": 177, "h": 6, "text": "六、人名、地名及專有名詞的第一個字母要大寫，其他的全部用小寫。例："}, {"x": 60, "y": 191, "w": 158, "h": 6, "text": "sua nganai maku ia Pani Kanapaniana�’esi ku Namásia tuísua takituturua�"}, {"x": 60, "y": 200, "w": 129, "h": 6, "text": "我的名字叫Pani Kanapaniana。我在Namásia擔任老師。"}, {"x": 49, "y": 218, "w": 128, "h": 5, "text": "七、文章段落第一行要空相當於四個字母的間隔。例："}, {"x": 71, "y": 227, "w": 184, "h": 5, "text": "sua Pani tamna tarisinata ia, nimúciri na vʉcʉke cimʉrʉ�ciciri tarisinata ia’una mapúnarʉ"}, {"x": 60, "y": 233, "w": 210, "h": 6, "text": "tantanau�’itúmuru tapinange monoon’inia paracani;’una kangvang ta’anna mataa anu mingangane na"}, {"x": 60, "y": 240, "w": 157, "h": 5, "text": "vungavung�paira Pani moon na mavúca’ʉracʉcʉna arapana’ʉsumasima’ʉ�"}, {"x": 71, "y": 249, "w": 197, "h": 5, "text": "Pani的學校座落於山腰，學校周邊有廣闊的森林。有許多的鳥兒在那裡歌唱；也有蝴"}, {"x": 60, "y": 258, "w": 142, "h": 5, "text": "蝶與蜜蜂在花朵裡飛舞。Pani常常在柔軟的青草上奔跑玩耍。"}, {"x": 293, "y": 31, "w": 5, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 290, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 74, "text": "附錄一　族語標點符號及範例"}, {"x": 290, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "167"}]}
