{"page": 221, "rows": [{"x": 47, "y": 40, "w": 128, "h": 14, "text": "附錄三　長篇語料一"}, {"x": 129, "y": 72, "w": 64, "h": 9, "text": "muana’ʉtaniarʉ"}, {"x": 153, "y": 87, "w": 13, "h": 6, "text": "射日"}, {"x": 60, "y": 104, "w": 214, "h": 8, "text": "(1) miana’ʉnai mamane mita ia, urucin kani meesua taniarʉ�(2)’apapuiri urucin"}, {"x": 47, "y": 114, "w": 187, "h": 7, "text": "taniarʉarapipiningi,ímua tantaniara maciasʉtaniara,’akia mapitʉ’ʉ�"}, {"x": 235, "y": 113, "w": 39, "h": 8, "text": "(3) muru’inasʉ"}, {"x": 47, "y": 122, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "cau meesua, sii ka’anʉtavara’ʉtia nukanmana aramia’ʉ�(4) tia nukanmana"}, {"x": 47, "y": 131, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "putukikio? (5) tia nukanmana tarasangai? (6) marápusu kavangvang’ʉnai mamane�(7)"}, {"x": 47, "y": 141, "w": 110, "h": 7, "text": "’akia cau tavara’ʉte cu makananu nuari�"}, {"x": 60, "y": 153, "w": 213, "h": 7, "text": "以前我們（卡那卡那富族）大地，那時有兩個太陽。兩個太陽輪流出現，"}, {"x": 47, "y": 165, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "所以每天都是白晝，沒有夜晚。當時的人類很困苦，因為不知道要何時起床？"}, {"x": 47, "y": 177, "w": 209, "h": 6, "text": "何時要工作？何時可以休息？大地非常的混亂，沒有人知道未來將如何。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 195, "w": 34, "h": 7, "text": "（1）miana"}, {"x": 80, "y": 195, "w": 60, "h": 7, "text": "’ʉnai mamane=mita"}, {"x": 171, "y": 195, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "ia,"}, {"x": 191, "y": 195, "w": 37, "h": 7, "text": "u-rucin=kani"}, {"x": 58, "y": 204, "w": 194, "h": 7, "text": "以前土地人間=我們�包含�屬格主題量詞�非人-二=據說"}, {"x": 58, "y": 217, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "meesua"}, {"x": 86, "y": 217, "w": 20, "h": 6, "text": "taniarʉ�"}, {"x": 58, "y": 226, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "那時"}, {"x": 80, "y": 226, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "太陽"}, {"x": 58, "y": 238, "w": 151, "h": 6, "text": "以前我們（卡那卡那富族）大地，那時有兩個太陽。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 253, "w": 44, "h": 7, "text": "（2）’apa-puiri"}, {"x": 99, "y": 253, "w": 22, "h": 7, "text": "u-rucin"}, {"x": 152, "y": 253, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "taniarʉ"}, {"x": 178, "y": 253, "w": 41, "h": 7, "text": "ara-pi-piningi,"}, {"x": 236, "y": 253, "w": 15, "h": 7, "tex