{"page": 225, "rows": [{"x": 44, "y": 41, "w": 34, "h": 6, "text": "（22）’akia"}, {"x": 106, "y": 41, "w": 9, "h": 6, "text": "na"}, {"x": 125, "y": 41, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "nguain"}, {"x": 158, "y": 41, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "tamna"}, {"x": 184, "y": 41, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "vuku�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 50, "w": 113, "h": 6, "text": "存在�否定詞處格他�主格屬於"}, {"x": 178, "y": 50, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "腰帶"}, {"x": 58, "y": 62, "w": 72, "h": 6, "text": "（但）不在他的腰帶上。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 78, "w": 79, "h": 6, "text": "（23）ti<kiri>kirimi-ʉn=kee"}, {"x": 158, "y": 78, "w": 10, "h": 6, "text": "na"}, {"x": 178, "y": 78, "w": 35, "h": 6, "text": "namuriungu"}, {"x": 217, "y": 78, "w": 18, "h": 6, "text": "tanasa,"}, {"x": 61, "y": 86, "w": 133, "h": 7, "text": "<重疊>找-受事焦點=他�屬格處格周邊"}, {"x": 210, "y": 86, "w": 20, "h": 7, "text": "家屋"}, {"x": 61, "y": 99, "w": 16, "h": 6, "text": "’akia!"}, {"x": 61, "y": 108, "w": 36, "h": 6, "text": "存在�否定詞"}, {"x": 61, "y": 120, "w": 121, "h": 6, "text": "他家裡四周找找，沒有（找到那個木片）！"}, {"x": 44, "y": 136, "w": 67, "h": 6, "text": "（24）pa-cʉpʉ-cʉpʉngʉ"}, {"x": 119, "y": 136, "w": 24, "h": 6, "text": "nanakʉ,"}, {"x": 152, "y": 136, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "cu-curu"}, {"x": 191, "y": 136, "w": 24, "h": 6, "text": "nínparu!"}, {"x": 61, "y": 144, "w": 40, "h": 7, "text": "PA-重疊-心"}, {"x": 112, "y": 144, "w": 22, "h": 7, "text": "女性"}, {"x": 145, "y": 144, "w": 60, "h": 7, "text": "重疊-真的怪事"}, {"x": 61, "y": 157, "w": 66, "h": 6, "text": "少女心想，真是怪事！"}, {"x": 44, "y": 172, "w": 37, "h": 7, "text": "（25）nakai"}, {"x": 86, "y": 172, "w": 22, "h": 7, "text": "ka’anʉ"}, {"x": 112, "y": 172, "w": 41, "h": 7, "text": "kasakʉnʉ-ʉn,"}, {"x": 165, "y": 172, "w": 30, "h": 7, "text": "makenanu"}, {"x": 204, "y": 172, "w": 25, "h": 7, "text": "ma-roka�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 181, "w": 17, "h": 7, "text": "但是"}, {"x": 80, "y": 181, "w": 77, "h": 7, "text": "否定詞珍惜-受事焦點"}, {"x": 158, "y": 181, "w": 30, "h": 7, "text": "沒關係"}, {"x": 197, "y": 181, "w": 50, "h": 7, "text": "