{"page": 227, "rows": [{"x": 60, "y": 40, "w": 214, "h": 7, "text": "(37) aratatia cu sua manu sarunai naParumaci�(38)’apaco’e ka’anʉpa"}, {"x": 47, "y": 49, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "nimararupang, nakai mintasʉcu mataa’una’íntasʉ�(39)’esi cu kipapapa sasarunai"}, {"x": 47, "y": 58, "w": 225, "h": 7, "text": "aracakanʉ�(40) paira noo cini’ʉra cu kee tapinange ia, rangrang cu manguru�(41)"}, {"x": 47, "y": 67, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "iacu’uʉn kee, mupana’ʉ, matapari’i cu�(42) kavangvang marʉkurapʉ, makai vutunu,"}, {"x": 47, "y": 76, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "vavuru, takuisi, to’urung,’apaco’e’anuka maa cini’ʉraa kee, mátʉa tavara’ʉnguain"}, {"x": 47, "y": 85, "w": 97, "h": 7, "text": "’apaica nipaicaa marʉkurapʉpáriku�"}, {"x": 145, "y": 84, "w": 129, "h": 8, "text": "(43) atʉnʉn kee mupana’ʉumara�(44) mamʉmʉkʉ"}, {"x": 47, "y": 93, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "nguain tamna kʉkʉnang�(45)’esi pakʉnnanu kee mara sua marʉkurapʉísua? (46) tia"}, {"x": 47, "y": 102, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "taniara’ʉn kʉkʉnang in�(47)’una cani taniara,’esi na rʉmʉra aracakanʉ, pasiin"}, {"x": 47, "y": 112, "w": 124, "h": 7, "text": "kʉkʉnang in,“Parumaci! mucanumua pa kasu�”"}, {"x": 172, "y": 111, "w": 102, "h": 8, "text": "(48) makacang naParumaci pakíturu�(49)"}, {"x": 47, "y": 120, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "’acecu mucanumu�(50) miaa mucanumu nguain ia, niara kʉkʉnang in nguain tamna"}, {"x": 47, "y": 129, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "kakicu�(51) putuvʉrʉkʉcumacʉ’ʉra neni’esi tisikariin? (52)’una kani vuru, rupacʉ,"}, {"x": 47, "y": 138, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "mataa vava tutui�(53) takutavara’ʉnaParumaci, koo arakuracʉmeesua�(54) nakai miaa"}, {"x": 47, "y": 147, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "pui’i cu tanasa ia, tuturuʉn kee nguain tamna cina�(55) pasiin cina in,“’akuni aka"}, {"x": 47, "y": 157, "w": 227, "h": 6, "text": "cʉpʉngʉ! manmaan kavangvang kʉkʉnang musu arakukunu kasua�uranoo nguani"}, {"x": 47, "y": 165, "w": 209, "h": 7, "text": "’uma’anupu�noo’unainíkasu tamna niaracakana ia, sovunguo na kincaucaua�”"}, {"x": 60, "y": 181, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "那位名為naParumaci的男孩長大了，雖然還沒有成年，但是力量與膽識都"}, {"x": 47, "y": 193, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "已經足夠，可以跟隨成年的男士出獵。每次只要被他看到的鳥類，（鳥類）都"}, {"x": 47, "y": 204, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "很難逃走，只要他瞄準、射擊，鳥就掉下來了。所有的獸類，像鹿、山豬、山"}, {"x": 47, "y": 216, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "羊、山羌，雖然他只看到獸蹄，他可以循著足跡追上去，找到獵物射擊捕獲。"}, {"x": 47, "y": 228, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "他的同伴們非常的疑惑，究竟怎樣獲得那些獵物？他的同伴們想對他搗蛋。有"}, {"x": 47, "y": 240, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "一天，當他們在叢林狩獵時，他的同伴們（跟他）說：「Parumaci你去挑水」。"}, {"x": 47, "y": 252, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "naParumaci立刻答應，去挑水。當他離去的時候，他的同伴拿起他的背袋，"}, {"x": 47, "y": 264, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "打開來看看，裡面究竟有些什麼？有箭矢、弓和豬肋骨。naParumaci獲知（此"}, {"x": 47, "y": 276, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "事），當場並沒有生氣，只是回家的時候告訴了媽媽。他媽媽（跟他說）：「不要"}, {"x": 47, "y": 288, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "難過，你的同伴都喜歡跟你在一起。你要協助他們追獵物，如果有收穫，也要"}, {"x": 47, "y": 299, "w": 54, "h": 7, "text": "與親友們分享。」。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 318, "w": 52, "h": 7, "text": "（37）ara-tatia=cu"}, {"x": 119, "y": 318, "w": 12, "h": 7, "text": "sua"}, {"x": 139, "y": 318, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "manu"}, {"x": 165, "y": 318, "w": 22, "h": 7, "text": "sarunai"}, {"x": 191, "y": 318, "w": 38, "h": 7, "text": "na-Parumaci�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 327, "w": 94, "h": 6, "text": "變-大=狀態改變主格孩子"}, {"x": 158, "y": 327, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "男性"}, {"x": 184, "y": 327, "w": 37, "h": 6, "text": "已故-人名"}, {"x": 61, "y": 339, "w": 105, "h": 7, "text": "那位名為naParumaci的男孩長大了。"}, {"x": 290, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 45, "text": "附錄三　長篇語料"}, {"x": 293, "y": 31, "w": 5, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 290, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "203"}]}
