{"page": 231, "rows": [{"x": 47, "y": 40, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "naParumaci�(69) pasiin kee rʉ’ʉvʉin,“noo mupana’ʉku taniarʉia, te kita makacang"}, {"x": 47, "y": 49, "w": 228, "h": 7, "text": "musutavʉrʉna canumu�”(70) ararakau cu sua taniarʉ�(71) urunguʉn nguani tamna"}, {"x": 47, "y": 58, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "takusini cumai�(72)’urúpaca cu nguain tamna rupacʉmupana’ʉna taniarʉ�(73)"}, {"x": 47, "y": 67, "w": 25, "h": 7, "text": "musucʉk"}, {"x": 76, "y": 67, "w": 198, "h": 7, "text": "cʉkʉna taniarʉvuru�(74) musutavʉrʉcu nguani na canumu�(75) koo"}, {"x": 47, "y": 75, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "pakisapatʉsua rʉ’ʉvʉin, nipunai taniarʉtamna nimúru’u�(76) macici curu, mamacai"}, {"x": 47, "y": 84, "w": 155, "h": 8, "text": "’inia�(77) niarasurumu arapitʉ’ʉ’ʉnai mamane�(78) matisap"}, {"x": 205, "y": 85, "w": 69, "h": 7, "text": "sapʉnaParumaci mukʉrʉ"}, {"x": 47, "y": 93, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "tarisi pui’i na tanasa�(79) mama’ari sii masíraru nimati’arangʉcu cina in marínguna"}, {"x": 47, "y": 102, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "karu mataa’uringi�(80) matupuru sua cina in�(81) tavara’ʉcu naParumaci’apaica"}, {"x": 47, "y": 112, "w": 89, "h": 7, "text": "sinangʉísua makacʉkʉna tanasa�"}, {"x": 60, "y": 127, "w": 213, "h": 7, "text": "naParumaci成年了，自己製作了很大的弓箭，媽媽問（跟他）說：「你這"}, {"x": 47, "y": 139, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "弓箭是要幹什麼的？」，naParumaci回答：「我要射下一個太陽。」，他媽媽說："}, {"x": 44, "y": 151, "w": 229, "h": 7, "text": "「就隨你的心意吧！」從那時開始，他們準備了乾柴和芒草莖，還製作了很長的"}, {"x": 47, "y": 163, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "繩索。到了那天，他跟媽媽說：「我要去（射日）了。」他把繩子拴在家裡的柱"}, {"x": 47, "y": 175, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "子，拉到他要去的地方，已經很接近太陽了，就在那裡等待著。據說，當時有"}, {"x": 47, "y": 187, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "一位男士跟隨naParumaci前往，他對同伴說，當我射擊太陽時，我們要立即浸"}, {"x": 47, "y": 198, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "泡水裡。太陽出現了，他們脫下熊皮披風，就用他的大弓箭射向太陽，箭矢插"}, {"x": 47, "y": 210, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "進了太陽，他們入水浸泡，不過他的同伴沒趕得及，被太陽的血噴到了，因為"}, {"x": 47, "y": 222, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "太熱當場死去。大地突然變暗，naParumaci握著繩子摸索回家。幸好他媽媽原"}, {"x": 47, "y": 234, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "先已備妥了乾柴和芒草莖，他媽媽點燃火，naParumaci可以靠著那個光線抵達"}, {"x": 47, "y": 246, "w": 20, "h": 7, "text": "家裡。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 265, "w": 70, "h": 6, "text": "（56）ni-mararupang=cu"}, {"x": 139, "y": 265, "w": 34, "h": 6, "text": "na-Parumaci�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 273, "w": 107, "h": 7, "text": "完成貌-成年=狀態改變已故-人名"}, {"x": 61, "y": 286, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "naParumaci成年了。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 301, "w": 46, "h": 7, "text": "（57）takacicini"}, {"x": 99, "y": 301, "w": 35, "h": 7, "text": "kamanʉngʉ"}, {"x": 139, "y": 301, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "rupacʉ"}, {"x": 165, "y": 301, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "tatia�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 310, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "獨自做"}, {"x": 93, "y": 310, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "製作"}, {"x": 132, "y": 310, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "弓箭"}, {"x": 158, "y": 310, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "大"}, {"x": 61, "y": 323, "w": 72, "h": 6, "text": "自己製作了很大的弓箭。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 338, "w": 40, "h": 7, "text": "（58）pasi-ʉn"}, {"x": 106, "y": 338, "w": 24, "h": 7, "text": "cina=in,"}, {"x": 158, "y": 338, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "“tia"}, {"x": 184, "y": 338, "w": 42, "h": 7, "text": "naumani=musu"}, {"x": 250, "y": 338, "w": 12, "h": 7, "text": "tatia"}, {"x": 61, "y": 347, "w": 89, "h": 7, "text": "說-受事焦點媽媽=他�屬格"}, {"x": 152, "y": 347, "w": 90, "h": 7, "text": "非實現做什麼用=你�屬格"}, {"x": 243, "y": 347, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "大"}, {"x": 61, "y": 359, "w": 20, "h": 7, "text": "rupacʉ"}, {"x": 86, "y": 359, "w": 12, "h": 7, "text": "isi?”"}, {"x": 61, "y": 368, "w": 17, "h": 7, "text": "弓箭"}, {"x": 80, "y": 368, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "這"}, {"x": 61, "y": 381, "w": 141, "h": 6, "text": "媽媽問（跟他）說：「你這弓箭是要幹什麼的？」"}, {"x": 290, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 45, "text": "附錄三　長篇語料"}, {"x": 293, "y": 31, "w": 5, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 290, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "207"}]}
