22, "h": 6, "text": "sinangʉ�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 166, "w": 9, "h": 6, "text": "旺"}, {"x": 93, "y": 166, "w": 31, "h": 6, "text": "他�主格"}, {"x": 125, "y": 166, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "屬於"}, {"x": 152, "y": 166, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "光線"}, {"x": 61, "y": 178, "w": 105, "h": 6, "text": "但是流血過久，它的光源不再強烈。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 194, "w": 44, "h": 6, "text": "（100）masini"}, {"x": 93, "y": 194, "w": 12, "h": 6, "text": "sua"}, {"x": 112, "y": 194, "w": 41, "h": 6, "text": "cʉ’ʉra-a=mita"}, {"x": 204, "y": 194, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "vuanʉ"}, {"x": 230, "y": 194, "w": 10, "h": 6, "text": "ia,"}, {"x": 250, "y": 194, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "nguai"}, {"x": 65, "y": 202, "w": 16, "h": 7, "text": "現在"}, {"x": 86, "y": 202, "w": 109, "h": 7, "text": "主格看-關係詞=我們�包含�屬格"}, {"x": 197, "y": 202, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "月亮"}, {"x": 223, "y": 202, "w": 40, "h": 7, "text": "主題就是"}, {"x": 65, "y": 215, "w": 12, "h": 6, "text": "sua"}, {"x": 86, "y": 215, "w": 35, "h": 6, "text": "ni-pana’ʉ-a"}, {"x": 152, "y": 215, "w": 17, "h": 6, "text": "miana"}, {"x": 178, "y": 215, "w": 20, "h": 6, "text": "taniarʉ�"}, {"x": 65, "y": 224, "w": 78, "h": 6, "text": "主格完成貌-射-關係詞"}, {"x": 145, "y": 224, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "過去"}, {"x": 171, "y": 224, "w": 20, "h": 6, "text": "太陽"}, {"x": 65, "y": 236, "w": 143, "h": 6, "text": "現在我們所看到的月亮，就是當時被射殺的太陽。"}, {"x": 19, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 45, "text": "附錄三　長篇語料"}, {"x": 22, "y": 31, "w": 6, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 20, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "214"}]}
{"page": 239, "rows": [{"x": 47, "y": 40, "w": 71, "h": 14, "text": "長篇語料二"}, {"x": 133, "y": 72, "w": 54, "h": 9, "text": "míri’i canumu"}, {"x": 153, "y": 87, "w": 17, "h": 6, "text": "洪水"}, {"x": 60, "y": 104, "w": 214, "h": 8, "text": "(1) nívatu ucani vʉrʉnga tatia�(2) kurisivatʉna cakʉran�(3) tumʉpʉcakʉran�(4)"}, {"x": 47, "y": 113, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "aratumuru cu canumu�(5) umanguru cau�(6) mu’urú’uru múkusa maraa ti’ingai cimʉrʉ,"}, {"x": 47, "y": 122, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "nakai iávatu pa canumu maripunarʉ’inia�(7) mucanʉcau arávari na cucumeni cimʉrʉ"}, {"x": 47, "y": 131, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "tatia�(8) mu’una37 cu’inia cau�(9) maunangʉarakukunu mataa marʉkurakurapʉ�(10) ka’anʉ"}, {"x": 47, "y": 140, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "tavara’ʉpo’ucipi kʉna, sii’akia’apuru�(11) muru’inasʉcau�(12) matacuvucuvungu"}, {"x": 47, "y": 149, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "makaríkari neni tia’aparʉʉn’apuru�(13) miaasua kani ia,’inmámia to’urung pakíturu"}, {"x": 47, "y": 158, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "tia kani mara’apuru�(14) kipátʉsʉnguain makananguru mucanʉmúkusa Tanungu’incu�"}, {"x": 47, "y": 167, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "(15) nikiri kee’apuru na u’ungu in�(16) makananguru kani pui’i�(17) musutavʉrʉu’ungu"}, {"x": 47, "y": 176, "w": 176, "h": 7, "text": "in�(18) ma’ʉpʉkangvang niara kee’apuru�(19) arapepe cu pui’i�"}, {"x": 224, "y": 176, "w": 51, "h": 7, "text": "(20) maká’ʉna cau"}, {"x": 47, "y": 184, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "makaríkari�(21) te cu makananu! (22) marivivini cu tapinange urunai makasi,“iku kʉcʉ"}, {"x": 47, "y": 193, "w": 228, "h": 8, "text": "mingane múkusa sipara mara’apuru!”(23) niara’isi kee’apuru umavici mingane pui’i�"}, {"x": 47, "y": 202, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "(24) sii nimiaranau rumara’isi’apuru, nimitavu ivici in masinang cu�(25) niaramasinang"}, {"x": 47, "y": 211, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "cu matárava masini�(26) macangcangarʉcau sosomanpe’inia,ímua ka’anʉkita"}, {"x": 47, "y": 221, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "tumatinara’ʉtapinangeísua, mataa noo kaisisi, nukai’una kacangcangara cau"}, {"x": 47, "y": 230, "w": 147, "h": 6, "text": "arakukunu ia, tia paracani sosomanpe tapinange urunai�"}, {"x": 60, "y": 242, "w": 213, "h": 7, "text": "來了一條大鰻魚，倒臥在河流上，堵住了水流使水滿出來了，人們逃離，"}, {"x": 47, "y": 254, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "先往比較低的山，但是水還是沖平了那裡，人們再逃往別處較高的山，人類就"}, {"x": 47, "y": 266, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "在那裡與獸類安然相處在一起。因為沒有火，無法煮東西吃，人們非常困苦，"}, {"x": 47, "y": 278, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "聚在一起討論誰可以去取火種。據說當時只有山羌願意前往取火種，牠努力地"}, {"x": 47, "y": 290, "w": 225, "h": 6, "text": "游往玉山（Tanungu’incu）的方向，把火種綁在頭角上再游回來，但是牠的角"}, {"x": 47, "y": 302, "w": 225, "h": 6, "text": "被水浸泡了，所取回的火種也熄滅了，空手而返。人們再度討論，要怎麼辦"}, {"x": 47, "y": 313, "w": 225, "h": 7, "text": "啊！到了最後，紅嘴黑鵯鳥說：「由我飛去對岸拿火種吧！」牠啣著火種飛回"}, {"x": 47, "y": 325, "w": 225, "h": 7, "text": "來，因為牠咬火種太久了，嘴巴被燙到而變紅了，直到現在還是紅色的。人們"}, {"x": 47, "y": 337, "w": 225, "h": 7, "text": "高興地對牠表示感恩，所以直到現在我們不會對那種鳥搗蛋，以及若逢到有祭"}, {"x": 47, "y": 349, "w": 150, "h": 7, "text": "典或高興的事情，聚在一起的時候要唱感謝牠的歌。"}, {"x": 47, "y": 389, "w": 157, "h": 6, "text": "37　僅有非常年長之耆老會使用mu’una，目前族人皆用moon (na)。"}, {"x": 290, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 45, "text": "附錄三　長篇語料"}, {"x": 293, "y": 31, "w": 5, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 290, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "215"}]}
