疊-話語"}, {"x": 126, "y": 181, "w": 40, "h": 7, "text": "<重疊>動物"}, {"x": 178, "y": 181, "w": 90, "h": 7, "text": "MARI-不好=我們�排除�主格"}, {"x": 61, "y": 194, "w": 31, "h": 6, "text": "marisauvu"}, {"x": 99, "y": 194, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "kamua�"}, {"x": 139, "y": 194, "w": 34, "h": 6, "text": "ka’anʉ=kim"}, {"x": 217, "y": 194, "w": 10, "h": 6, "text": "tia"}, {"x": 243, "y": 194, "w": 29, "h": 6, "text": "arakukunu"}, {"x": 61, "y": 202, "w": 8, "h": 7, "text": "聞"}, {"x": 93, "y": 202, "w": 37, "h": 7, "text": "你們�斜格"}, {"x": 132, "y": 202, "w": 126, "h": 7, "text": "否定詞=我們�排除�主格非實現一起"}, {"x": 61, "y": 215, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "kamua"}, {"x": 99, "y": 215, "w": 49, "h": 6, "text": "c<um>a-cʉvʉrʉ�”"}, {"x": 61, "y": 224, "w": 31, "h": 6, "text": "你們�斜格"}, {"x": 99, "y": 224, "w": 73, "h": 6, "text": "Ca重疊<主事焦點>-生長"}, {"x": 61, "y": 236, "w": 212, "h": 6, "text": "獸類討論說：「我們不喜歡聞你們人類的味道，我們不要跟你們人類一起"}, {"x": 61, "y": 245, "w": 25, "h": 6, "text": "生活。」"}, {"x": 44, "y": 260, "w": 40, "h": 7, "text": "（37）makasi"}, {"x": 106, "y": 260, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "cau,"}, {"x": 125, "y": 260, "w": 29, "h": 7, "text": "“’apaco’e"}, {"x": 165, "y": 260, "w": 27, "h": 7, "text": "te=kamu"}, {"x": 230, "y": 260, "w": 31, "h": 7, "text": "pana’ʉ-ʉn�”"}, {"x": 61, "y": 269, "w": 55, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點�說人"}, {"x": 119, "y": 269, "w": 36, "h": 7, "text": "無論如何"}, {"x": 158, "y": 269, "w": 64, "h": 7, "text": "非實現=你們�主格"}, {"x": 223, "y": 269, "w": 43, "h": 7, "text": "射-受事焦點"}, {"x": 61, "y": 282, "w": 113, "h": 6, "text": "人類回答說，「無論如何要射殺你們。」"}, {"x": 44, "y": 297, "w": 37, "h": 7, "text": "（38）aranai"}, {"x": 86, "y": 297, "w": 28, "h": 7, "text": "miaasua,"}, {"x": 119, "y": 297, "w": 38, "h": 7, "text": "ma’icʉpʉ=cu"}, {"x": 197, "y": 297, "w": 32, "h": 7, "text": "marʉkurapʉ"}, {"x": 61, "y": 306, "w": 8, "h": 7, "text": "從"}, {"x": 80, "y": 306, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "當時"}, {"x": 112, "y": 306, "w": 78, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點�怕=狀態改變"}, {"x": 191, "y": 306, "w": 21, "