{"page": 246, "rows": [{"x": 60, "y": 40, "w": 214, "h": 7, "text": "(39) sua cau ia, arávari múkusa’ʉnai Nacʉnga�(40) moon cu’inia ka’umó’uma,"}, {"x": 47, "y": 49, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "(41) macangcangarʉcu cau’una kʉna�(42) miaasua ia,’apaco’e makangʉcʉnimʉkʉa"}, {"x": 47, "y": 58, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "cau, nakai musutanpʉkʉna�(43) makaan ka’umó’uma mumʉkʉ�(44) ka’anʉ"}, {"x": 47, "y": 67, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "kovangvangʉʉn ucani cenana, mataa ka’anʉpa cau musukʉmʉ�(45) miaranau cau"}, {"x": 47, "y": 75, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "moon na Nacʉnga�(46) niarakacaua cau�(47) mamʉmʉkʉ’akia cu tia takamanʉnga"}, {"x": 47, "y": 84, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "‘umó’uma�(48)’una cau aranai’inia arávari na Na’usurana�(49) ka’umó’uma"}, {"x": 47, "y": 93, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "makangʉcʉ�(50) kipapa’inia tacau in nipívura�(51) nimoon’inia kamanúmanu�(52) te"}, {"x": 47, "y": 103, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "pa kani pui’i Nacʉnga, sii’esi pa’inia kʉna ni, nakai iávatu cina tamtitu umavici"}, {"x": 47, "y": 111, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "manu in pui’i na Na’usurana�(53) makásua cu, a’unuʉn cu cau kʉna ni pariviviniʉn"}, {"x": 47, "y": 120, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "tacau in arávari na Na’usurana�(54) mu’una’inia kamanʉngʉtanasa ni�(55) aranai’inia"}, {"x": 47, "y": 129, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "iávatu cu cau cucumeni�(56) kavangvang mu’una cu’inia miaranau ka’umó’uma�(57)"}, {"x": 47, "y": 139, "w": 78, "h": 6, "text": "aranai’inia arakacaua cu cau�"}, {"x": 60, "y": 151, "w": 213, "h": 7, "text": "人們遷移到Nacʉnga39之地，在那裡開墾闢地，人們非常快樂有充足的食"}, {"x": 47, "y": 163, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "物。當時雖然只種植少量的農作，但是足夠食用。種一次田，一年也吃不完，"}, {"x": 47, "y": 175, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "還有當時的人類還不會生病。人們在Nacʉnga待了很久，人變多了，憂心沒有"}, {"x": 47, "y": 186, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "地方可耕作了，有人從那裡（Nacʉnga）遷移到Na’usurana（藤苞山40）之地，"}, {"x": 47, "y": 198, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "只開闢少量的田園。跟隨去的狗懷孕了，在那裡生了小狗。據說人們還要再回"}, {"x": 47, "y": 210, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "Nacʉnga之地，因為他們的食物還在那裡，但是小狗的媽媽來把他的小孩帶去"}, {"x": 47, "y": 222, "w": 225, "h": 7, "text": "Na’usurana。之後，人們就背著他們的食物跟著他們的狗遷移到Na’usurana，待"}, {"x": 47, "y": 234, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "在那裡蓋他們的住家。之後其他人也跟來了，所有的人都在那裡耕作很久，自"}, {"x": 47, "y": 246, "w": 46, "h": 7, "text": "此人就變多了。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 265, "w": 30, "h": 6, "text": "（39）sua"}, {"x": 86, "y": 265, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "cau"}, {"x": 106, "y": 265, "w": 10, "h": 6, "text": "ia,"}, {"x": 125, "y": 265, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "arávari"}, {"x": 184, "y": 265, "w": 24, "h": 6, "text": "m-ukusa"}, {"x": 230, "y": 265, "w": 17, "h": 6, "text": "’ʉnai"}, {"x": 61, "y": 274, "w": 17, "h": 6, "text": "主格"}, {"x": 80, "y": 274, "w": 16, "h": 6, "text": "人"}, {"x": 99, "y": 274, "w": 77, "h": 6, "text": "主題主事焦點�換位置"}, {"x": 178, "y": 274, "w": 68, "h": 6, "text": "主事焦點-去土地"}, {"x": 61, "y": 286, "w": 26, "h": 6, "text": "Nacʉnga."}, {"x": 61, "y": 295, "w": 13, "h": 6, "text": "地名"}, {"x": 61, "y": 307, "w": 78, "h": 7, "text": "人們遷移到Nacʉnga之地。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 323, "w": 46, "h": 6, "text": "（40）moon=cu"}, {"x": 145, "y": 323, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "’inia"}, {"x": 171, "y": 323, "w": 37, "h": 6, "text": "ka-’umó’uma�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 331, "w": 75, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點�待在=狀態改變"}, {"x": 139, "y": 331, "w": 22, "h": 7, "text": "那裡"}, {"x": 165, "y": 331, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "做-田"}, {"x": 61, "y": 344, "w": 53, "h": 6, "text": "在那裡開墾闢地。"}, {"x": 47, "y": 381, "w": 183, "h": 6, "text": "39　部落耆老們也不清楚Nacʉnga在現今何處，指著太陽出現的方向（台東）。"}, {"x": 47, "y": 390, "w": 144, "h": 5, "text": "40　藤苞山是現今高雄市那瑪夏區南沙魯里正上方最高的山。"}, {"x": 19, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 45, "text": "附錄三　長篇語料"}, {"x": 22, "y": 31, "w": 6, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 20, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "222"}]}
