{"page": 251, "rows": [{"x": 47, "y": 40, "w": 71, "h": 14, "text": "長篇語料三"}, {"x": 105, "y": 72, "w": 110, "h": 9, "text": "cakʉran Namásia tamna’ʉna"}, {"x": 137, "y": 87, "w": 46, "h": 6, "text": "楠梓仙溪的故事"}, {"x": 60, "y": 104, "w": 214, "h": 8, "text": "(1) Namásia kisʉʉn’ʉnai tanasʉn Kanakanavu�(2) sua nganai isi ia, niaranai upeni"}, {"x": 47, "y": 113, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "kusai mʉna cenana miana�(3) nipatanganai cau Kanakanavu cakʉran nesi�(4)’esi"}, {"x": 47, "y": 123, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "masini tamna niaritapasaa’ʉnai ia,’una niarupaca Nakasayana tamna sinatʉ"}, {"x": 47, "y": 131, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "“Nancʉsiensii”kisʉʉn�(5) nganai isi ia, manasʉniaranai kisaa mita“Namásia”�(6)"}, {"x": 47, "y": 140, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "’urupacʉʉn kari Pakísia pokaríkari�(7)’apaica cu kari in marisinatʉ�(8) matárava"}, {"x": 47, "y": 149, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "mamisa tamna cenana, nganai isi, tunganganʉn cu kavangvang sua’ʉnai�(9) nakai"}, {"x": 47, "y": 158, "w": 228, "h": 7, "text": "niaranai nanu sua nganai Namásia isi?(10) matárava masini, makai’akia pa mátʉa"}, {"x": 47, "y": 167, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "siatuturu�(11) mataa paira noo karanana cau tumatúturu’ʉna ia, karanana kavangvang"}, {"x": 47, "y": 176, "w": 168, "h": 7, "text": "kari in�(12) rocu niarisinata, nguai sua urucin karanana siatúturu�"}, {"x": 60, "y": 192, "w": 213, "h": 6, "text": "卡那卡那富族的部落地名稱為那瑪夏。這個名稱是來自於數百年之前，卡"}, {"x": 47, "y": 204, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "那卡那富族人為此地的溪流所命名的。在現代的地圖裡這個溪流用中文標示為"}, {"x": 44, "y": 215, "w": 229, "h": 7, "text": "「楠梓仙溪」，這個名稱很可能是來自於我們所稱的「那瑪夏」，用閩南語發音，"}, {"x": 47, "y": 227, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "再寫出來的。到了最近的年代，這個名稱才由溪流名稱包含到地理名稱。但是"}, {"x": 47, "y": 239, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "那瑪夏這個名稱又是怎麼來的呢？到目前為止，似乎沒有一致的說法，而且會"}, {"x": 47, "y": 251, "w": 216, "h": 7, "text": "常因不同的講述人而有不同的說法。以下的紀錄就是兩則完全不同的說法。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 270, "w": 41, "h": 6, "text": "（1）Namásia"}, {"x": 93, "y": 270, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "kisa-ʉn"}, {"x": 145, "y"