{"page": 253, "rows": [{"x": 44, "y": 41, "w": 44, "h": 6, "text": "（10）matárava"}, {"x": 93, "y": 41, "w": 47, "h": 6, "text": "masini, makai"}, {"x": 145, "y": 41, "w": 28, "h": 6, "text": "’akia=pa"}, {"x": 204, "y": 41, "w": 19, "h": 6, "text": "mátʉa"}, {"x": 61, "y": 50, "w": 8, "h": 6, "text": "到"}, {"x": 86, "y": 50, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "現在"}, {"x": 112, "y": 50, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "像"}, {"x": 139, "y": 50, "w": 55, "h": 6, "text": "存在�否定詞=還"}, {"x": 197, "y": 50, "w": 20, "h": 6, "text": "相同"}, {"x": 61, "y": 62, "w": 27, "h": 6, "text": "sia-tuturu�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 71, "w": 43, "h": 6, "text": "工具焦點-告訴"}, {"x": 61, "y": 83, "w": 105, "h": 7, "text": "到目前為止，似乎沒有一致的說法。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 99, "w": 37, "h": 6, "text": "（11）mataa"}, {"x": 86, "y": 99, "w": 17, "h": 6, "text": "paira"}, {"x": 106, "y": 99, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "noo"}, {"x": 125, "y": 99, "w": 26, "h": 6, "text": "karanana"}, {"x": 158, "y": 99, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "cau"}, {"x": 178, "y": 99, "w": 41, "h": 6, "text": "t<um>a-túturu"}, {"x": 256, "y": 99, "w": 13, "h": 6, "text": "’ʉna"}, {"x": 61, "y": 108, "w": 8, "h": 6, "text": "和"}, {"x": 80, "y": 108, "w": 34, "h": 6, "text": "常常當"}, {"x": 119, "y": 108, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "不同"}, {"x": 152, "y": 108, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "人"}, {"x": 178, "y": 108, "w": 91, "h": 6, "text": "Ca重疊<主事焦點>-告知故事"}, {"x": 61, "y": 120, "w": 11, "h": 6, "text": "ia,"}, {"x": 86, "y": 120, "w": 28, "h": 6, "text": "karanana"}, {"x": 119, "y": 120, "w": 35, "h": 6, "text": "kavangvang"}, {"x": 158, "y": 120, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "kari=in�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 129, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "主題"}, {"x": 80, "y": 129, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "不同"}, {"x": 112, "y": 129, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "也"}, {"x": 152, "y": 129, "w": 49, "h": 6, "text": "話語=他�屬格"}, {"x": 61, "y": 141, "w": 124, "h": 7, "text": "而且會常因不同的講述人而有不同的說法。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 157, "w": 33, "h": 6, "text": "（12）rocu"}, {"x": 99, "y": 157, "w": 42, "h": 6, "text": "ni-ari-sinat