{"page": 257, "rows": [{"x": 44, "y": 41, "w": 50, "h": 6, "text": "（28）ka’anʉ=cu"}, {"x": 125, "y": 41, "w": 28, "h": 6, "text": "cʉ’ʉra-ʉn�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 50, "w": 53, "h": 6, "text": "否定詞=狀態改變"}, {"x": 119, "y": 50, "w": 43, "h": 6, "text": "看-受事焦點"}, {"x": 61, "y": 62, "w": 26, "h": 6, "text": "不見了。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 78, "w": 83, "h": 6, "text": "（29）ma-ka-tumuru=cu=kani"}, {"x": 184, "y": 78, "w": 23, "h": 6, "text": "makásia�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 86, "w": 115, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點-做-多（次）=狀態改變=據說"}, {"x": 178, "y": 86, "w": 19, "h": 7, "text": "這樣"}, {"x": 61, "y": 99, "w": 53, "h": 6, "text": "數次見面都如此。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 114, "w": 57, "h": 7, "text": "（30）makásua=cu,"}, {"x": 119, "y": 114, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "’una"}, {"x": 139, "y": 114, "w": 9, "h": 7, "text": "tia"}, {"x": 165, "y": 114, "w": 29, "h": 7, "text": "aracakanʉ"}, {"x": 197, "y": 114, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "cau�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 123, "w": 47, "h": 7, "text": "那樣=狀態改變"}, {"x": 112, "y": 123, "w": 67, "h": 7, "text": "存在非實現打獵"}, {"x": 191, "y": 123, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "人"}, {"x": 61, "y": 136, "w": 66, "h": 6, "text": "後來，有人要去打獵。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 151, "w": 44, "h": 7, "text": "（31）ni-mavici"}, {"x": 106, "y": 151, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "kʉnʉ-a"}, {"x": 145, "y": 151, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "tia"}, {"x": 171, "y": 151, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "mo-vua"}, {"x": 217, "y": 151, "w": 14, "h": 7, "text": "’inia�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 160, "w": 76, "h": 7, "text": "完成貌-攜帶吃-關係詞"}, {"x": 139, "y": 160, "w": 70, "h": 7, "text": "非實現主事焦點-給"}, {"x": 210, "y": 160, "w": 30, "h": 7, "text": "他�斜格"}, {"x": 61, "y": 172, "w": 59, "h": 7, "text": "曾攜帶食物想給她。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 188, "w": 37, "h": 7, "text": "（32）nakai"}, {"x": 86, "y": 188, "w": 18, "h": 7, "text": "aranai"}, {"x": 112, "y": 188, "w": 23, "h": 7, "text": "meesua,"}, {"x": 145, "y": 188, "w": 24, "h": 7, "text": "akia=cu"}, {"x": 223, "y": 188, "w": 13, "h": 7, "text": "cau"}, {"x": 61, "y": 197, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "但是"}, {"x":