{"page": 258, "rows": [{"x": 44, "y": 41, "w": 52, "h": 6, "text": "（35）pa-cʉpʉngʉ"}, {"x": 99, "y": 41, "w": 25, "h": 6, "text": "tia=kara"}, {"x": 165, "y": 41, "w": 34, "h": 6, "text": "ma-ka-’ʉna"}, {"x": 223, "y": 41, "w": 36, "h": 6, "text": "ara-pi-piningi"}, {"x": 61, "y": 50, "w": 20, "h": 6, "text": "PA-心"}, {"x": 93, "y": 50, "w": 120, "h": 6, "text": "非實現=是非疑問詞主事焦點-做-再"}, {"x": 217, "y": 50, "w": 53, "h": 6, "text": "變成-重疊-外面"}, {"x": 61, "y": 62, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "nanakʉ"}, {"x": 93, "y": 62, "w": 13, "h": 6, "text": "ísua?"}, {"x": 61, "y": 71, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "女性"}, {"x": 86, "y": 71, "w": 13, "h": 6, "text": "那"}, {"x": 58, "y": 83, "w": 105, "h": 7, "text": "（族人）心想那女子會不會再出現？"}, {"x": 44, "y": 99, "w": 41, "h": 6, "text": "（36）mámia!"}, {"x": 93, "y": 99, "w": 16, "h": 6, "text": "’akia"}, {"x": 139, "y": 99, "w": 24, "h": 6, "text": "kamʉcʉ"}, {"x": 171, "y": 99, "w": 27, "h": 6, "text": "cʉ’ʉra-a�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 108, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "可惜"}, {"x": 86, "y": 108, "w": 44, "h": 6, "text": "存在�否定詞"}, {"x": 132, "y": 108, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "但願"}, {"x": 165, "y": 108, "w": 36, "h": 6, "text": "看-關係詞"}, {"x": 60, "y": 120, "w": 66, "h": 6, "text": "可惜！什麼都沒看到。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 139, "w": 50, "h": 6, "text": "（37）marivivini,"}, {"x": 126, "y": 139, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "’una"}, {"x": 145, "y": 139, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "cau"}, {"x": 165, "y": 139, "w": 34, "h": 6, "text": "pa-cʉpʉngʉ"}, {"x": 204, "y": 139, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "makasi"}, {"x": 250, "y": 139, "w": 20, "h": 6, "text": "manasʉ"}, {"x": 61, "y": 147, "w": 57, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點�跟隨在後"}, {"x": 119, "y": 147, "w": 34, "h": 7, "text": "存在人"}, {"x": 165, "y": 147, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "PA-心"}, {"x": 197, "y": 147, "w": 44, "h": 7, "text": "主事焦點�說"}, {"x": 243, "y": 147, "w": 20, "h": 7, "text": "或許"}, {"x": 61, "y": 160, "w": 27, "h": 6, "text": "ni-aranai"}, {"x": 106, "y": 160, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "’ʉnai"}, {"x": 132, "y": 160, "w": 25, "h": 6, "text": "“Másia”,"}, {"x": 165, "y": 160, "w": 16, "h": 6, "text": "ímua"}, {"x": 191, "y": 160, "w": 33, "h": 6, "text": "Namásia=cu"}, {"x": 61, "y": 169, "w": 60, "h": 6, "text": "完成貌-來自土地"}, {"x": 125, "y": 169, "w": 22, "h": 6, "text": "瑪夏"}, {"x": 158, "y": 169, "w": 21, "h": 6, "text": "所以"}, {"x": 184, "y": 169, "w": 59, "h": 6, "text": "那瑪夏=狀態改變"}, {"x": 61, "y": 181, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "kisa-ʉn"}, {"x": 112, "y": 181, "w": 35, "h": 6, "text": "Kanakanavu"}, {"x": 152, "y": 181, "w": 24, "h": 7, "text": "cakʉran"}, {"x": 184, "y": 181, "w": 8, "h": 6, "text": "isi�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 190, "w": 105, "h": 6, "text": "稱為-受事焦點卡那卡那富河流"}, {"x": 178, "y": 190, "w": 13, "h": 6, "text": "這"}, {"x": 61, "y": 202, "w": 212, "h": 7, "text": "後來，有族人猜想該女可能是來自「瑪夏」之地的人，所以卡那卡那富族"}, {"x": 61, "y": 211, "w": 66, "h": 7, "text": "人就稱此為那瑪夏溪。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 227, "w": 37, "h": 6, "text": "（38）mámia"}, {"x": 86, "y": 227, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "’ʉna"}, {"x": 106, "y": 227, "w": 9, "h": 6, "text": "isi"}, {"x": 119, "y": 227, "w": 9, "h": 6, "text": "sii"}, {"x": 138, "y": 227, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "koo"}, {"x": 165, "y": 227, "w": 39, "h": 6, "text": "t<um>a-túturu"}, {"x": 61, "y": 236, "w": 14, "h": 6, "text": "可惜"}, {"x": 80, "y": 236, "w": 80, "h": 6, "text": "故事這因為否定詞"}, {"x": 165, "y": 236, "w": 52, "h": 6, "text": "<主事焦點>-告知"}, {"x": 61, "y": 248, "w": 28, "h": 7, "text": "’una=kara"}, {"x": 119, "y": 248, "w": 15, "h": 7, "text": "’imi"}, {"x": 139, "y": 248, "w": 17, "h": 6, "text": "nukai"}, {"x": 165, "y": 248, "w": 14, "h": 7, "text": "’esi"}, {"x": 184, "y": 248, "w": 16, "h": 6, "text": "nanu"}, {"x": 204, "y": 248, "w": 9, "h": 6, "text": "sua"}, {"x": 61, "y": 257, "w": 92, "h": 6, "text": "存在=是非疑問詞意義或者"}, {"x": 158, "y": 257, "w": 15, "h": 6, "text": "在"}, {"x": 178, "y": 257, "w": 39, "h": 6, "text": "哪裡主格"}, {"x": 61, "y": 269, "w": 20, "h": 7, "text": "kisa-a"}, {"x": 99, "y": 269, "w": 26, "h": 7, "text": "Másia?"}, {"x": 61, "y": 278, "w": 58, "h": 6, "text": "稱為-關係詞瑪夏"}, {"x": 61, "y": 290, "w": 170, "h": 7, "text": "可惜這則故事沒有交代所稱的「瑪夏」有何意義或在何方？"}, {"x": 60, "y": 323, "w": 214, "h": 8, "text": "(39) ucani karanana siatúturu�(40)miaa araceni miana ia,’una kani tacini sarunai"}, {"x": 47, "y": 332, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "nanmarua�（41) Másia sua nganai in�(42) cinicʉ’ʉra vʉrʉnga tatia tumʉpʉcakʉran"}, {"x": 47, "y": 341, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "tamna canumu�(43) niaramíri’i canumu�(44)’apitarʉsua tanasʉn cau�(45) makacang"}, {"x": 47, "y": 351, "w": 84, "h": 7, "text": "nguain pui’i tia tumatúturu cau�"}, {"x": 133, "y": 350, "w": 141, "h": 8, "text": "(46) nakai miaa arapana’ʉpui’i ia, nimupacai curu�(47)"}, {"x": 47, "y": 359, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "koo siapeni taniara niaraka cu�(48) nakai sii tinituruʉn cu kee cau, nimu’uru’uru"}, {"x": 47, "y": 368, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "arávari na ka’anʉ’apitarʉto’unaa�(49) makásua’apakʉrʉpa ngisaa cau�(50) marivivini"}, {"x": 47, "y": 377, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "cu, niara’isi kani vavuru sua vʉrʉngaísua�(51) mamacai�(52) ma’acunu�(53) para’akia"}, {"x": 47, "y": 386, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "’apitarʉ�(54) pacʉpʉngʉn cau Kananakavu sua nanmaruaísua�(55) aranai meesua,"}, {"x": 19, "y": 130, "w": 8, "h": 45, "text": "附錄三　長篇語料"}, {"x": 22, "y": 31, "w": 6, "h": 57, "text": "卡那卡那富語語法概論"}, {"x": 20, "y": 19, "w": 10, "h": 7, "text": "234"}]}
{"page": 259, "rows": [{"x": 47, "y": 40, "w": 227, "h": 8, "text": "“Namásia”cu kisʉʉn Kanakanavu sua cakʉran isi�(56) Kanakanavu tamna niurina,"}, {"x": 47, "y": 50, "w": 227, "h": 6, "text": "noo tiain matanganai niaraka cu kincaucaua ia, to’urua ngana in ia, te pa“na”misee,"}, {"x": 47, "y": 58, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "sii tia kineeng mataa pacʉpʉngʉ’inia misee�(57) urucin’ʉna isi,’apaco’e karanana"}, {"x": 47, "y": 67, "w": 227, "h": 7, "text": "siatúturu, nakai tavara’ʉn cu sua nganai Namásia isi ia, masíraru niaranai nipatanganai"}, {"x": 47, "y": 75, "w": 90, "h": 8, "text": "Kanakanavu�(58) ka’anʉmuriva’ʉ�"}, {"x": 57, "y": 92, "w": 216, "h": 6, "text": "（另外）一則不同說法，相傳遠古時代，據說有一位名叫「瑪夏」的年輕男"}, {"x": 47, "y": 104, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "子，看到巨大鱸鰻堵住溪流，水滿出來，危及部落的安全。他趕緊回部落向族"}, {"x": 47, "y": 115, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "人通報，然因在奔向部落時，體力已耗盡，沒過幾天即去世。但是族人因已獲"}, {"x": 47, "y": 127, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "得通報，提早移至不危險的地方，族人得以保住性命。之後，據說山豬咬了那"}, {"x": 47, "y": 139, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "隻鱸鰻，（那隻鱸鰻）死了而流走，讓危機解除。族人為了懷念那名青年，從那"}, {"x": 47, "y": 151, "w": 226, "h": 7, "text": "時起就以其名「那瑪夏」稱呼此溪流。族人的習慣，若要稱呼已過世的親人，"}, {"x": 47, "y": 163, "w": 226, "h": 6, "text": "在其名字之前要加「那」，含有紀念與懷念之意。這兩則故事說法雖不同，但可"}, {"x": 47, "y": 175, "w": 216, "h": 6, "text": "以確定的是那瑪夏這個名稱，源自卡那卡那富族族的命名，應該是無誤的。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 193, "w": 37, "h": 7, "text": "（39）u-cani"}, {"x": 112, "y": 193, "w": 28, "h": 7, "text": "karanana"}, {"x": 145, "y": 193, "w": 28, "h": 7, "text": "sia-túturu�"}, {"x": 61, "y": 202, "w": 41, "h": 7, "text": "量詞�非人-一"}, {"x": 106, "y": 202, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "不同"}, {"x": 139, "y": 202, "w": 49, "h": 7, "text": "工具焦點-告知"}, {"x": 58, "y": 215, "w": 72, "h": 6, "text": "（另外）一則不同說法。"}, {"x": 44, "y": 230, "w": 32, "h": 7, "text": "（40）miaa"}, {"x": 86, "y": 230, "w": 21, "h": 7, "text": "araceni"}, {"x": 112, "y": 230, "w": 18, "h": 7, "text": "miana"}, {"x": 139, "y": 230, "w": 8, "h": 7, "text": "ia,"}, {"x": 158, "y": 230, "w": 28, "h": 7, "text": "’una=kani"}